window.LK_VEHICULES = [{"id":"albany-emperor","nom":"Emperor","marque":"Albany","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Cadillac Sedan de Ville 1977-1980","src":"Official screenshots","search":"albany emperor cadillac sedan de ville 1977-1980","txt":"Albany has always been the brand of big, plush American cars, and the Emperor is the archetype: long hood, thick C-pillar, soft suspension. The 1977 to 1980 Cadillac Sedan de Ville whose look it borrows was an aging boss’s car that, over the years, became the quintessential used sedan, the one you find rusting in working-class neighborhoods. The screenshots released by Rockstar show it parked along a Vice City curb.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cadillac%20Sedan%20de%20Ville","reelNom":"Cadillac Sedan de Ville","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-emperor.svg"},{"id":"albany-primo","nom":"Primo","marque":"Albany","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Pontiac Bonneville from the late 80s","src":"First trailer","search":"albany primo pontiac bonneville late 80s","txt":"The Primo holds a special place in the series: a sedan with no prestige but mechanically sound, it’s the customizers’ favorite base. The late-80s Pontiac Bonneville that inspires it was a big mass-market American car, built in huge numbers and resold cheap a decade later, which made it a go-to base for South Florida’s lowrider culture. The first trailer shows it passing by in a street shot.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pontiac%20Bonneville%20fin%20des%20ann%C3%A9es%2080","reelNom":"Pontiac Bonneville from the late 80s","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-primo.svg"},{"id":"albany-primo-custom","nom":"Primo Custom","marque":"Albany","cat":"berline","st":"comm","insp":"Buick Regal","src":"Community match","search":"albany primo custom buick regal","txt":"Same body as the Primo, done up as a lowrider: lowered suspension, thin wire wheels, special-effect paint. It’s the variant that fits Vice City best, where the Cuban and Puerto Rican lowrider scene is a strong cultural marker. The Rideout Customs shop, shown on our map, is the kind of place where this kind of build would be done. Model not confirmed by Rockstar for Leonida.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Regal","reelNom":"Buick Regal","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-primo-custom.svg"},{"id":"benefactor-schafter-v12","nom":"Schafter V12","marque":"Benefactor","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Brabus E V12","src":"First trailer","search":"benefactor schafter v12 brabus e v12","txt":"The Schafter V12 is a Benefactor sports sedan. The match chosen here is the Brabus E V12. It’s listed from the first trailer through a community identification; Rockstar doesn’t give its name there.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Brabus%20E%20V12","reelNom":"Brabus E V12","thumb":"/img/schemas/benefactor-schafter-v12.svg"},{"id":"karin-asterope","nom":"Asterope","marque":"Karin","cat":"berline","st":"comm","insp":"Previous-generation Toyota Camry","txt":"Japanese family sedan, the best-selling car in its segment in the United States for decades. The newer GZ variant is already in this database.","search":"karin asterope toyota camry previous generation","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20Camry%20pr%C3%A9c%C3%A9dente","reelNom":"Previous-generation Toyota Camry","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-asterope.svg"},{"id":"karin-asterope-gz","nom":"Asterope GZ","marque":"Karin","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Toyota Camry (XV30)","src":"Official screenshots","search":"karin asterope gz toyota camry (xv30)","txt":"Karin is the universe’s mainstream Japanese brand, and the Asterope is its everyman car. The Toyota Camry it’s based on has been the best-selling sedan in the United States for decades, precisely because it never draws attention. The GZ suffix suggests a slightly higher trim level. It shows up in the official screenshots, lost in Leonida’s everyday traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20Camry%20(XV30)","reelNom":"Toyota Camry (XV30)","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-asterope-gz.svg"},{"id":"lampadati-feroci","nom":"Feroci","marque":"Karin","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"First-generation Lexus GS 300","txt":"The Feroci is based on the first-generation Lexus GS 300, designed by Giugiaro and launched in 1993. It was Toyota’s attempt to establish a premium sports sedan against the German cars: flawless build quality, an inline six, and a low profile that cost it on the sales charts. Karin is the universe’s Toyota, which makes the attribution consistent.","search":"karin feroci lexus gs 300 first generation","src":"Extended Look","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lexus%20GS%20300","reelNom":"Lexus GS 300","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/lampadati-feroci.svg"},{"id":"karin-intruder","nom":"Intruder","marque":"Karin","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Infiniti Q45/I30","src":"First trailer","search":"karin intruder infiniti q45/i30","txt":"The Intruder is modeled on the Infiniti Q45 and I30, the luxury sedans Nissan launched in the United States to take on Lexus. The bet never really paid off: well built and comfortable, but without a strong identity next to the German cars. As a result, you find them cheap on the used market today, exactly the kind of car that fills Vice City’s parking lots without anyone looking twice.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Infiniti%20Q45%2FI30","reelNom":"Infiniti Q45/I30","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-intruder.svg"},{"id":"audi-a7-rs7","nom":"A7 RS7","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Audi RS7","src":"First trailer","txt":"High-performance German sedan-coupe, four doors and a sloping roofline. The RS7 is the archetypal fast car that goes unnoticed: five hundred horsepower under the body of a sales manager’s sedan. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand a7 rs7 audi rs7 second generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20RS7","reelNom":"Audi RS7","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/audi-a7-rs7.svg"},{"id":"honda-accord-10","nom":"Accord","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Tenth-generation Honda Accord","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Mass-market Japanese sedan, tenth generation. The Accord is one of the best-selling cars in US history, to the point of becoming invisible in the urban landscape. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand accord honda accord tenth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20Accord%20dixi%C3%A8me","reelNom":"Honda Accord tenth gen","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/honda-accord-10.svg"},{"id":"mercedes-c-w205","nom":"C-Class","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205","src":"Second trailer","txt":"W205-generation German compact sedan, built from 2014 to 2021. It’s the model that brought the Mercedes star to the masses, and the quintessential company car across the Western world. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand c-class mercedes-benz c-class w205","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Classe%20C%20W205","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/mercedes-c-w205.svg"},{"id":"chevrolet-impala-10","nom":"Impala","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Tenth-generation Chevrolet Impala","src":"First trailer","txt":"Big American sedan from the 2000s, the last front-wheel-drive generation. Bought in bulk by fleets, rental companies and government agencies, it’s the anonymous car in its purest form. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand impala chevrolet impala tenth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Impala%20dixi%C3%A8me","reelNom":"Chevrolet Impala tenth gen","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chevrolet-impala-10.svg"},{"id":"volkswagen-jetta","nom":"Jetta","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Volkswagen Jetta","src":"Extended Look","txt":"German compact sedan, the three-box version of the Golf, very popular in the United States where hatchbacks sell poorly. Spotted in the Extended Look. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand jetta volkswagen jetta","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Volkswagen%20Jetta","reelNom":"Volkswagen Jetta","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/volkswagen-jetta.svg"},{"id":"chrysler-lebaron-town-country","nom":"LeBaron Town & Country","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Chrysler LeBaron Town & Country 1986-1988","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Family station wagon with fake wood paneling on the sides, spotted in the Extended Look. This walnut-look vinyl trim is an American tradition that dates back to the 40s and that Chrysler kept going into the 80s. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand lebaron town & country chrysler lebaron town & country 1986-1988","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chrysler%20LeBaron%20Town%20%26%20Country","reelNom":"Chrysler LeBaron Town & Country","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chrysler-lebaron-town-country.svg"},{"id":"oceanic","nom":"Oceanic","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"comm","insp":"Chevrolet Bel Air 1950","txt":"Postwar American sedan, rounded fenders, two-piece windshield. It belongs to the generation before tailfins, the era of the first big migrations to Florida.","search":"unknown brand oceanic chevrolet bel air 1950","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Bel%20Air%201950","reelNom":"Chevrolet Bel Air 1950","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/oceanic.svg"},{"id":"buick-regal-6","nom":"Regal","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Buick Regal","src":"First trailer","txt":"Midrange American sedan from the 2010s, derived from a European Opel. At the time, Buick was trying to bring younger buyers to an aging customer base, without much success. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand regal buick regal sixth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Regal","reelNom":"Buick Regal","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buick-regal-6.svg"},{"id":"chrysler-sebring-dodge-stratus","nom":"Sebring","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Chrysler Sebring","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Mass-market sedan from the late 2000s, twin of the Dodge Stratus. Often cited as one of the least successful American cars of its time, which didn’t stop it from filling rental fleets. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand sebring chrysler sebring second generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chrysler%20Sebring","reelNom":"Chrysler Sebring","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chrysler-sebring-dodge-stratus.svg"},{"id":"buick-skylark-6","nom":"Skylark","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Buick Skylark","src":"Second trailer","txt":"American compact sedan from the 80s, built in huge numbers on General Motors’ X platform. These cars aged badly and now turn up on the streets of working-class neighborhoods, which fits Leonida’s setting well. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand skylark buick skylark sixth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Skylark","reelNom":"Buick Skylark","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buick-skylark-6.svg"},{"id":"chevrolet-sonic","nom":"Sonic","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Sonic","src":"First trailer","txt":"The Chevrolet Sonic, an entry-level city car sold by the hundreds of thousands in the United States. Modest four-cylinder, bare-bones cabin: it’s the first-paycheck car or the rental-fleet car. Rockstar hasn’t given it an in-game name yet. The first trailer shows it stopped at a light, among everyday cars.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Sonic","reelNom":"Chevrolet Sonic","search":"unknown brand sonic chevrolet sonic","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chevrolet-sonic.svg"},{"id":"ford-taurus","nom":"Taurus","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Taurus","src":"Extended Look","txt":"American family sedan, one of Ford’s biggest sales hits in the 80s and 90s. Its rounded body caused a stir when it came out, before becoming the industry standard. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand taurus ford taurus","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Taurus","reelNom":"Ford Taurus","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-taurus.svg"},{"id":"obey-tailgater","nom":"Tailgater","marque":"Obey","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Audi A6","src":"First trailer","search":"obey tailgater audi a6","txt":"Obey is the series’ premium German brand, and the Tailgater is its entry-level sedan, the car of the manager who’s starting to make it. The Audi A6 that inspires it is a sober all-wheel-drive cruiser, built to eat up the miles without emotion. A profile that fits Downtown’s business districts. The first trailer puts it on screen for the length of a traffic shot.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20A6","reelNom":"Audi A6","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/obey-tailgater.svg"},{"id":"obey-tailgater-s","nom":"Tailgater S","marque":"Obey","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Audi RS3 Sedan","src":"Official screenshots","search":"obey tailgater s audi rs3 sedan","txt":"A longer, better-equipped version of the Tailgater, like the relationship between an Audi A4 and an A6: same design language, more length, more subtle chrome. It’s the executive sedan, the one with a chauffeur. The official screenshots single it out, sitting on its stock wheels.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20RS3%20Sedan","reelNom":"Audi RS3 Sedan","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/obey-tailgater-s.svg"},{"id":"schyster-pmp-700","nom":"PMP 700","marque":"Schyster","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Chrysler 300","src":"First trailer","search":"schyster pmp 700 chrysler 300 second generation","txt":"The PMP 700 is a chauffeur-driven executive sedan, in the vein of the big stretched German sedans. This kind of vehicle handles transfers between the airport and the beachfront hotels, a huge amount of traffic in Miami. The first trailer frames it from a rear three-quarter angle, crawling along in a line of traffic.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-027"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-027":"Big green sedan in the right foreground, GTA VI’s first trailer at 00:27"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chrysler%20300","reelNom":"Chrysler 300","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-027-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-stanier-moderne","nom":"Stanier","marque":"Vapid","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Crown Victoria","src":"First trailer","txt":"The modern Stanier, separate from the Ultimate Edition’s Stanier ’55. It’s based on the Ford Crown Victoria, a rear-wheel-drive, body-on-frame sedan that served as America’s police car and taxi for more than twenty years. Indestructible, heavy, and instantly recognizable.","search":"vapid stanier ford crown victoria","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Crown%20Victoria","reelNom":"Ford Crown Victoria","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-stanier-moderne.svg"},{"id":"vapid-stanier","nom":"Stanier ’55","marque":"Vapid","cat":"berline","st":"officiel","insp":"1956 Ford Fairlane Club Sedan","src":"First trailer","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"vapid stanier ’55 1956 ford fairlane club sedan","txt":"The Stanier ’55 is one of the few vehicles whose name Rockstar has published, in the Vintage Vice City Pack. Our official screenshots show the two-tone yellow and cream body, the rear fins, the disc hubcaps and the script badge on the fender. The 1955 Ford Fairlane whose lines it borrows belongs to that postwar generation when American cars started to look like airplanes. A logical choice for a city that cherishes its nostalgia.","edition":"Pre-Order","medias":["55-vapid-stanier-01","55-vapid-stanier-02","55-vapid-stanier-03","55-vapid-stanier-04"],"vuesDeclarees":["profil","arriere","interieur","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1956%20Ford%20Fairlane%20Club%20Sedan","reelNom":"1956 Ford Fairlane Club Sedan","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/55-vapid-stanier-01-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-stratum","nom":"Stratum","marque":"Zirconium","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Honda Accord station wagon","txt":"Mass-market family station wagon, upright tailgate and roof rails. The Stratum is the ultimate background vehicle: everywhere, noticed nowhere, and so perfect when you don’t want to get spotted.","search":"zirconium stratum honda accord station wagon","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20Accord%20station%20wagon","reelNom":"Honda Accord station wagon","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-stratum.svg"},{"id":"albany-manana","nom":"Manana","marque":"Albany","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Buick LeSabre, Cadillac Eldorado","src":"Official screenshots","search":"albany manana buick lesabre, cadillac eldorado","txt":"The Manana is an American personal luxury coupe from the 70s: two doors, vinyl roof, front bench seat. The series has always treated it as a neighborhood car, often seen as a lowrider. Its huge size for just two seats sums up the era that produced it pretty well. The official screenshots show it at a custom shop, ready for paint.","medias":["rideout-customs-mod-shop-01","ultimate-edition-rideout-customs-02","ultimate-edition-rideout-customs-03"],"imageAlts":{"ultimate-edition-rideout-customs-02":"Red interior of the car shown in the Rideout Customs screenshot series","ultimate-edition-rideout-customs-03":"Lifted yellow coupe in the Rideout Customs shop, identified as an Albany Manana"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20LeSabre","reelNom":"Buick LeSabre","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/rideout-customs-mod-shop-01-480.webp"},{"id":"albany-v-str","nom":"V-STR","marque":"Albany","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"2019 Cadillac CTS-V","src":"Official screenshots","search":"albany v-str 2019 cadillac cts-v","txt":"The V-STR is Albany’s attempt at a modern sports car, which for a brand of big American cruisers is a bit of a stretch. The badge recalls the three-letter names Cadillac made its signature on its performance models. The official screenshots show it standing still, grille in full view.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2019%20Cadillac%20CTS-V","reelNom":"2019 Cadillac CTS-V","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-v-str.svg"},{"id":"annis-elegy-retro-custom","nom":"Elegy Retro Custom","marque":"Annis","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Nissan Skyline GT-R","src":"First trailer","search":"annis elegy retro custom nissan skyline gt-r","txt":"The Elegy is the series’ tuner icon, and its Retro Custom version is the most sought after. The Nissan Skyline R32 that inspires it is a monument of Japanese car culture: all-wheel drive, an inline six, and total domination in racing that earned it the nickname Godzilla. The Custom suffix means a widebody kit and a wing. The first trailer sends it down an avenue, filmed at headlight height.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Nissan%20Skyline%20GT-R","reelNom":"Nissan Skyline GT-R","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/annis-elegy-retro-custom.svg"},{"id":"benefactor-schafter-lwb","nom":"Schafter LWB","marque":"Benefactor","cat":"sport","st":"comm","insp":"Long-wheelbase Mercedes-Benz E-Class","txt":"Long-wheelbase version of the Schafter, designed for the back seat rather than the driver. In Leonida, it’s the car of someone who gets driven around: Vice City hotels, the airport, nights out.","search":"benefactor schafter lwb long-wheelbase mercedes-benz e-class","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Classe%20E%20allong%C3%A9e","reelNom":"Long-wheelbase Mercedes-Benz E-Class","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/benefactor-schafter-lwb.svg"},{"id":"bravado-banshee","nom":"Banshee","marque":"Bravado","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Viper","src":"Second trailer","search":"bravado banshee dodge viper","txt":"The Banshee has been a series staple since Vice City, with a silhouette instantly linked to the Dodge Viper. The fifth-generation Dodge Viper whose proportions it borrows is a brutal car: a truck V10 in a narrow chassis, without the electronic aids that make modern sports cars easy to handle. The Banshee is listed from the second trailer, with no name given by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Viper","reelNom":"Dodge Viper","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-banshee.svg"},{"id":"bravado-buffalo","nom":"Buffalo","marque":"Bravado","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Charger","src":"First trailer","search":"bravado buffalo dodge charger","txt":"Bravado is the American muscle car brand, and the Buffalo is its sports sedan: four doors, big engine, stiff chassis. In previous games, it was used as much by the police as by gangs, which says a lot about where it sits. The first trailer shows it driving through Vice City traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Charger","reelNom":"Dodge Charger","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-buffalo.svg"},{"id":"bravado-buffalo-s","nom":"Buffalo S","marque":"Bravado","cat":"sport","st":"comm","insp":"Dodge Charger SRT8","txt":"The sporty version of the Buffalo: more aggressive side skirts, hood scoop, solid wheels. On the real Charger, this version marked the return of the four-door American muscle car in the 2010s.","search":"bravado buffalo s dodge charger srt8","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Charger%20SRT8","reelNom":"Dodge Charger SRT8","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-buffalo-s.svg"},{"id":"coil-raiden","nom":"Raiden","marque":"Coil","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Tesla Model S","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Coil’s electric sedan, modeled on the Tesla Model S: no grille, flush door handles, full torque available the moment you lift off the brake. It’s the car of Leonida’s wealthy neighborhoods. The official screenshots show it plugged into a charger.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Tesla%20Model%20S","reelNom":"Tesla Model S","search":"coil raiden tesla model s","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/coil-raiden.svg"},{"id":"declasse-mamba-gt","nom":"Mamba GT","marque":"Declasse","cat":"sport","st":"officiel","insp":"Shelby Daytona Coupe","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"declasse mamba gt shelby daytona coupe","txt":"The Mamba GT is among the models Rockstar named in the Ultimate Edition catalog. The Shelby Daytona Coupe whose look it borrows is a race car born from a constraint: making an open Cobra aerodynamic enough to hold its own on the straight at the 24 Hours of Le Mans. The result, with its chopped tail and raked windshield, won the world championship in 1965. Only six were ever built.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["classic-car-collection-04"],"vuesDeclarees":["detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Shelby%20Daytona%20Coup%C3%A9","reelNom":"Shelby Daytona Coupe","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/classic-car-collection-04-480.webp"},{"id":"dinka-blista-compact","nom":"Blista Compact","marque":"Dinka","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"First-generation Honda CR-X","src":"Official screenshots","search":"dinka blista compact honda cr-x first generation","txt":"Dinka is the universe’s Honda, and the Blista Compact is its sporty city car. The formula is familiar: small light car, peppy engine, front-wheel drive, affordable price. It’s the kind of vehicle that fills the streets rather than collectors’ garages. The official screenshots place it along a residential street.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20CR-X","reelNom":"Honda CR-X","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-blista-compact.svg"},{"id":"dinka-sugoi","nom":"Sugoi","marque":"Dinka","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Honda Civic Type R FK8","src":"Official screenshots","search":"dinka sugoi honda civic type r fk8","txt":"A sporty compact sedan, the Sugoi has a name that simply means “awesome” in Japanese, which says a lot about the series’ sense of humor. It belongs to that family of production cars that a few parts can turn into track machines. The official screenshots show it with its wing up, ready for the straight.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20Civic%20R%20FK8","reelNom":"Honda Civic R FK8","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-sugoi.svg"},{"id":"cheval-vectre","nom":"Vectre","marque":"Emperor","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Lexus RC F","src":"Second trailer","search":"emperor vectre lexus rc f","txt":"Emperor is the universe’s upscale Japanese brand, and the Vectre is its compact sports coupe. The name sounds like a contraction of “vector”, in the aerodynamic vein carmakers loved in the 90s. The second trailer slips it into a shot of city traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lexus%20RC%20F","reelNom":"Lexus RC F","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/cheval-vectre.svg"},{"id":"enus-paragon-r","nom":"Paragon R","marque":"Enus","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"2018 Bentley Continental GT","src":"Official screenshots","search":"enus paragon r 2018 bentley continental gt","txt":"The Paragon R is based on the 2018 Bentley Continental GT: four-seat coupe, W12 under the hood, and a weight no suspension can quite make you forget. It’s grand touring in the literal sense, the car that crosses a continent in one go. The R suffix marks the sharper version.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2018%20Bentley%20Continental%20GT","reelNom":"2018 Bentley Continental GT","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/enus-paragon-r.svg"},{"id":"enus-windsor","nom":"Windsor","marque":"Enus","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Rolls-Royce Wraith","src":"Second trailer","txt":"Enus’s high-luxury coupe, modeled on the Rolls-Royce Wraith: coach doors, endless hood, upright grille set like a pediment. It’s the car you park in front of a hotel to be seen getting out of. The second trailer catches it in profile.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rolls-Royce%20Wraith","reelNom":"Rolls-Royce Wraith","search":"enus windsor rolls-royce wraith","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/enus-windsor.svg"},{"id":"fathom-fr36","nom":"FR36","marque":"Fathom","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Infiniti G35 (V35)","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Fathom’s coupe is based on the first-generation Infiniti G35, a rear-wheel-drive Japanese car that became a tuning classic thanks to its six-cylinder engine and balanced chassis. The Extended Look frames it in a garage, hood up.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Infiniti%20G35%20(V35)","reelNom":"Infiniti G35 (V35)","search":"fathom fr36 infiniti g35 (v35)","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/fathom-fr36.svg"},{"id":"grotti-carbonizzare","nom":"Carbonizzare","marque":"Grotti","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Ferrari F12berlinetta and Aston Martin V12 Zagato","src":"First trailer","search":"grotti carbonizzare ferrari f12berlinetta and aston martin v12 zagato","txt":"Grotti is the series’ Ferrari, and the Carbonizzare is its front-engine grand tourer. The Ferrari F12 it’s modeled on is a road car in a class of its own: a naturally aspirated V12 with more than seven hundred horsepower, in a body sculpted to channel the air rather than slice through it. The first trailer shows it briefly as it speeds past.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-025"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-025":"Red convertible with a woman passenger standing up, GTA VI’s first trailer at 00:25"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20F12berlinetta","reelNom":"Ferrari F12berlinetta","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-025-480.webp"},{"id":"grotti-cheetah-classic","nom":"Cheetah ’95","marque":"Grotti","cat":"sport","st":"officiel","insp":"Ferrari Testarossa and 512 BB","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"grotti cheetah ’95 ferrari testarossa and 512 bb","txt":"Rockstar names the Cheetah ’95 in the Ultimate Edition catalog, and our four official screenshots show the white body with red stripes, the red leather interior, the five-spoke wheels and the badge on the tail. The Ferrari Testarossa whose styling cues it borrows became, for a whole generation, the very image of Miami: its side strakes and outsized proportions did more for the city’s mystique than any tourism campaign.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["95-grotti-cheetah-01","95-grotti-cheetah-02","95-grotti-cheetah-03","95-grotti-cheetah-04"],"vuesDeclarees":["face","profil","arriere","interieur"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20Testarossa","reelNom":"Ferrari Testarossa","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/95-grotti-cheetah-01-480.webp"},{"id":"grotti-itali-gto","nom":"Itali GTO","marque":"Grotti","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Ferrari 812 Superfast","src":"First trailer","search":"grotti itali gto ferrari 812 superfast","txt":"The Itali GTO borrows the design language of the Ferrari 812 Superfast: front-mounted V12, compact tail, clustered exhaust tips. The 812 is one of the last naturally aspirated twelve-cylinder Ferraris, which gives it a special status among collectors today. Its arrival in Leonida is still to be confirmed.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20812%20Superfast","reelNom":"Ferrari 812 Superfast","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/grotti-itali-gto.svg"},{"id":"grotti-itali-rsx","nom":"Itali RSX","marque":"Grotti","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Ferrari SF90 Stradale","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The most high-tech Grotti in the lineup, modeled on the Ferrari SF90 Stradale and its plug-in hybrid powertrain. Cut-off tail, high-mounted twin exhaust, active rear aero. The Extended Look sends it down an open stretch of highway.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20SF90%20Stradale","reelNom":"Ferrari SF90 Stradale","search":"grotti itali rsx ferrari sf90 stradale","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/grotti-itali-rsx.svg"},{"id":"invetero-coquette","nom":"Coquette","marque":"Invetero","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Corvette C7, 2014 Corvette Stingray","src":"Second trailer","search":"invetero coquette corvette c7, 2014 corvette stingray","txt":"Invetero’s Coquette is matched to the C7 Corvette, specifically the 2014 Corvette Stingray. This inspiration sets this page apart from the other Coquette generations. Our database lists it in the second trailer, with no name given by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Corvette%20C7","reelNom":"Corvette C7","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/invetero-coquette.svg"},{"id":"invetero-coquette-d10","nom":"Coquette D10","marque":"Invetero","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Corvette C8","src":"First trailer","search":"invetero coquette d10 chevrolet corvette c8","txt":"A hardcore version of the Coquette, in the spirit of the Corvette Z06: wider track, serious aero downforce, a sharper engine. The Z06 is traditionally the version Chevrolet aims at the track while keeping it street-legal. The first trailer has it burst into a night shot.","medias":["extended-look-coquette-d10"],"imageAlts":{"extended-look-coquette-d10":"Red convertible in the left foreground, still from An Extended Look"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Corvette%20C8","reelNom":"Chevrolet Corvette C8","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/extended-look-coquette-d10-480.webp"},{"id":"annis-futo","nom":"Futo","marque":"Karin","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Toyota AE86 Levin","src":"First trailer","search":"karin futo toyota ae86 levin","txt":"The Futo is the quintessential lightweight rear-wheel-drive car, the one you pick to learn to drift rather than to go fast. The Toyota AE86 whose silhouette it borrows has a huge aura: an affordable, well-balanced car, it became the symbol of grassroots drifting before manga culture made it famous. The first trailer shows it passing in the background, taillights on.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20AE86%20Levin","reelNom":"Toyota AE86 Levin","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/annis-futo.svg"},{"id":"karin-sultan","nom":"Sultan","marque":"Karin","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Lexus IS, Mitsubishi Lancer Evo VI, Subaru Impreza","src":"First trailer","search":"karin sultan lexus is, mitsubishi lancer evo vi, subaru impreza","txt":"The Sultan is the series’ all-wheel-drive sports sedan, the street rally car. The Subaru Impreza WRX that inspires it built its reputation on World Rally Championship stages, with its boxer engine and unflappable handling on rough surfaces. Its appearance is logged in the first trailer; the Sultan name is still a community identification.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lexus%20IS","reelNom":"Lexus IS","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-sultan.svg"},{"id":"karin-sultan-rs","nom":"Sultan RS","marque":"Karin","cat":"sport","st":"comm","insp":"Tuned Subaru Impreza WRX STI","txt":"The Sultan pushed into rally spec: fender flares, rear wing, hood scoop. It’s the benchmark Japanese all-wheel-drive compact, the one that defined an entire generation of tuning.","search":"karin sultan rs tuned subaru impreza wrx sti","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Subaru%20Impreza%20WRX%20STI","reelNom":"Subaru Impreza WRX STI","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-sultan-rs.svg"},{"id":"maibatsu-penumbra","nom":"Penumbra","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Mitsubishi Eclipse, Audi TT","src":"Second trailer","search":"maibatsu penumbra mitsubishi eclipse, audi tt","txt":"Maibatsu is the series’ mainstream Japanese brand, and the Penumbra its entry-level sports coupe. It belongs to that class of cars that offer a sports car’s looks without the hardware to match, which makes them very popular bases for tuning builds. The second trailer places it in traffic, headlights on.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mitsubishi%20Eclipse","reelNom":"Mitsubishi Eclipse","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/maibatsu-penumbra.svg"},{"id":"maibatsu-penumbra-ff","nom":"Penumbra FF","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Mitsubishi Eclipse, second-generation Eagle Talon","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The front-wheel-drive version of the Penumbra, based on the second-generation Mitsubishi Eclipse and its twin, the Eagle Talon. Pop-up headlights, glass hatch: it’s the quintessential 90s tuner car. The Extended Look catches it under full acceleration.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mitsubishi%20Eclipse","reelNom":"Mitsubishi Eclipse","search":"maibatsu penumbra ff mitsubishi eclipse second generation, eagle talon second generation","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/maibatsu-penumbra-ff.svg"},{"id":"mercedes-cle-a236","nom":"CLE-Class Cabriolet","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz CLE-Class (A236)","src":"Second trailer","txt":"Mercedes-Benz’s CLE convertible, the one that replaced both the C-Class and E-Class convertibles in one go. Fabric soft top, four tight seats, the star planted in the middle of the grille. It appears in the second trailer without having been given an in-game name.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Classe%20CLE%20(A236)","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz CLE-Class (A236)","search":"unknown brand cle-class cabriolet mercedes-benz cle-class (a236)","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/mercedes-cle-a236.svg"},{"id":"cadillac-eldorado-1959","nom":"Eldorado 1959","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Cadillac Eldorado 1959","src":"Second trailer","txt":"The 1959 Cadillac Eldorado, the one with the giant tailfins and rocket-shaped taillights, a symbol of America before the fuel crisis. It has been given neither an in-game name nor a fictional manufacturer. The second trailer has it cruising at a crawl along the waterfront.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cadillac%20Eldorado%201959","reelNom":"Cadillac Eldorado 1959","search":"unknown brand eldorado 1959 cadillac eldorado 1959","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/cadillac-eldorado-1959.svg"},{"id":"kellison-j4","nom":"Kellison J4","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Kellison J4","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A handbuilt 60s fiberglass roadster, built in small numbers by a California coachbuilder for weekend racing. Rockstar hasn’t given it an in-game name. The official screenshots show it standing still, hood closed.","medias":["ultimate-edition-02","classic-car-collection-05"],"imageAlts":{"ultimate-edition-02":"Jason and Lucia in front of the green coupe matched to a Kellison J4 in the Ultimate Edition image"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Kellison%20J4","reelNom":"Kellison J4","search":"unknown brand kellison j4 kellison j4","thumb":"/img/officiel/ultimate-edition-02-480.webp"},{"id":"lincoln-mark-viii","nom":"Mark VIII","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Lincoln Mark VIII","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Lincoln’s big personal luxury coupe, the last of the Mark line, with its rounded tail and full-width light bar. The in-game name hasn’t been announced. The Extended Look slips it into nighttime traffic, lights on.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Mark%20VIII","reelNom":"Lincoln Mark VIII","search":"unknown brand mark viii lincoln mark viii","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/lincoln-mark-viii.svg"},{"id":"buick-reatta-convertible","nom":"Reatta Convertible","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Buick Reatta Convertible","src":"Second trailer","txt":"A late-80s American convertible coupe, based on the Buick Reatta: angular lines, soft top, two seats and not one more. Rockstar hasn’t given it an in-game name yet. The second trailer leaves it parked facing the sea.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Reatta%20Convertible","reelNom":"Buick Reatta Convertible","search":"unknown brand reatta convertible buick reatta convertible","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buick-reatta-convertible.svg"},{"id":"obey-8f-drafter","nom":"8F Drafter","marque":"Obey","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"2018 Audi RS5 Coupe","src":"Official screenshots","search":"obey 8f drafter 2018 audi rs5 coupe","txt":"The 8F Drafter is Obey’s four-door coupe, the hybrid category German automakers invented to sell a sedan’s comfort with a coupe’s lines. The name refers to drafting in racing, when one car tucks into another’s slipstream. The official screenshots frame it in profile, against a parking lot backdrop.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2018%20Audi%20RS5%20Coupe","reelNom":"2018 Audi RS5 Coupe","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/obey-8f-drafter.svg"},{"id":"overflod-omnis-e-gt","nom":"Omnis e-GT","marque":"Obey","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Audi e-Tron GT","txt":"An electric grand touring coupe, with no visible exhaust or engine air intake. Leonida confirms the presence of electric vehicles and charging stations, which gives this category a real role in the game.","search":"obey omnis e-gt audi e-tron gt","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20e-Tron%20GT","reelNom":"Audi e-Tron GT","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/overflod-omnis-e-gt.svg"},{"id":"ocelot-jugular","nom":"Jugular","marque":"Ocelot","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Jaguar XE SV Project 8","src":"First trailer","search":"ocelot jugular jaguar xe sv project 8","txt":"Ocelot is the Jaguar of the GTA universe, and the Jugular its sports sedan. The Jaguar XE SV Project 8 whose proportions it borrows is a production sedan taken to the extreme: fixed wing, widened track and a supercharged V8 built for circuit driving. The first trailer has it cross a street shot in just a few frames.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jaguar%20XE%20SV%20Project%208","reelNom":"Jaguar XE SV Project 8","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ocelot-jugular.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-infernus-classic","nom":"Infernus Classic","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Lamborghini Diablo, Cizeta V16T, Ferrari Testarossa","src":"Extended Look","search":"pegassi infernus classic lamborghini diablo, cizeta v16t, ferrari testarossa","txt":"The Infernus is the series’ original supercar, around since GTA III. Its Classic version borrows styling cues from the Lamborghini Diablo and the Cizeta V16T: sharp angles, scissor doors, next to no rear visibility. The Diablo carried the teenage-bedroom-poster supercar look into the 90s. It’s spotted in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Diablo","reelNom":"Lamborghini Diablo","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-infernus-classic.svg"},{"id":"pfister-comet-retro-custom","nom":"Comet Retro Custom","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Rauh-Welt Porsche 911 930","src":"First trailer","search":"pfister comet retro custom rauh-welt porsche 911 930","txt":"Pfister is the Porsche of the GTA universe, and the Comet has always been its 911. The Retro Custom version draws on the G-Series 911s of the 70s and 80s, recognizable by their bellows bumpers. This generation, long overlooked, is now the most sought-after for builds. The first trailer shows it widened all around, flared arches included.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rauh-Welt%20Porsche%20911%20930","reelNom":"Rauh-Welt Porsche 911 930","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pfister-comet-retro-custom.svg"},{"id":"pfister-comet-s2","nom":"Comet S2","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"comm","insp":"Porsche 911 992","txt":"The Pfister coupe in its latest form, based on the 911 of the 992 generation. Engine hung out behind the rear axle, full-width light bar, widened tail. The Cabrio variant is already in this database.","search":"pfister comet s2 porsche 911 992","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20911%20992","reelNom":"Porsche 911 992","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pfister-comet-s2.svg"},{"id":"pfister-comet-s2-cabrio","nom":"Comet S2 Cabrio","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Porsche 911 Turbo S Cabriolet","src":"First trailer","search":"pfister comet s2 cabrio porsche 911 turbo s cabriolet","txt":"Convertible version of the modern Comet, modeled on the Porsche 911, type 992. What sets the open-top 911 apart is its layout: with the engine in the back, the body’s stiffness suffers less from losing the roof than on a conventional sports car. The first trailer shows it cruising top-down along the waterfront.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-033"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-033":"Turquoise convertible in the left foreground on the waterfront, GTA VI first trailer at 00:33"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20911%20Turbo%20S%20Cabriolet","reelNom":"Porsche 911 Turbo S Cabriolet","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-033-480.webp"},{"id":"annis-growler","nom":"Growler","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Porsche 718 Cayman","src":"Second trailer","search":"pfister growler porsche 718 cayman","txt":"The Growler is the Pfister coupe matched to the Porsche 718 Cayman in our database. It’s logged in the second trailer. Its identification is still a community one: the official material doesn’t give it a name.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20718%20Cayman","reelNom":"Porsche 718 Cayman","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/annis-growler.svg"},{"id":"pfister-neon","nom":"Neon","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Porsche Taycan, Porsche Panamera, Porsche 918 Spyder","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Pfister’s electric sedan, pieced together from several Porsches: the Taycan for the silhouette, the 918 Spyder for the nose, the Panamera for the roofline. Quiet and heavy, but able to launch very hard. The Extended Look follows it through the city.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20Taycan","reelNom":"Porsche Taycan","search":"pfister neon porsche taycan, porsche panamera, porsche 918 spyder","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pfister-neon.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-cypher","nom":"Cypher","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW M2 F87, with touches of M6 and M8","src":"First trailer","search":"ubermacht cypher bmw m2 f87, with touches of m6 and m8","txt":"Übermacht is the series’ BMW, and the Cypher its sharp compact coupe. The BMW M2 whose styling cues it borrows belongs to a line going back to the M3 of the 80s, a street-legal race car whose reputation was built on the track before the showroom. The first trailer frames it at a standstill, just before it takes off.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20M2%20F87","reelNom":"BMW M2 F87","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-cypher.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-sentinel-classic","nom":"Sentinel Classic","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW E30 M3","txt":"The Sentinel has been the BMW of the GTA universe since GTA III. The Classic version borrows the silhouette of the E30 of the 80s: flat hood, twin round headlights, thin C-pillars. It’s exactly the kind of German coupe you’d see on Ocean Drive in the era Vice City recreates.","search":"ubermacht sentinel classic bmw e30 m3","src":"Extended Look","medias":["extended-look-sentinel-classic-front","extended-look-sentinel-classic-rear"],"imageAlts":{"extended-look-sentinel-classic-front":"Red convertible in front of shops, still from An Extended Look","extended-look-sentinel-classic-rear":"Red convertible seen from behind during a driving sequence in An Extended Look"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20E30%20M3","reelNom":"BMW E30 M3","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/extended-look-sentinel-classic-front-480.webp"},{"id":"ubermacht-sentinel-xs","nom":"Sentinel XS","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW M3 E92","txt":"The modern version of the Sentinel, modeled on the 3 Series of the 2000s and 2010s. Compact rear-wheel-drive coupe, integrated bumpers, strong shoulder line. The benchmark for the mass-market German sports sedan.","search":"ubermacht sentinel xs bmw m3 e92","src":"Second trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20M3%20E92","reelNom":"BMW M3 E92","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-sentinel-xs.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-zion","nom":"Zion","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW M6 E63","src":"Official screenshots","search":"ubermacht zion bmw m6 e63","txt":"Übermacht’s upscale coupe, the Zion plays the grand touring card rather than pure performance: two doors, four seats, an engine that’s plenty without being over the top. It’s the car of someone who has made it and no longer needs to prove it. The official screenshots show it parked at an angle, roof up.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20M6%20E63","reelNom":"BMW M6 E63","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-zion.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-zion-cabrio","nom":"Zion Cabrio","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW 6 Series E64","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The open-top version of the Zion, based on the BMW 6 Series E64 designed in the Bangle era, controversial tail included. Four seats, a fabric soft top, a six-cylinder that holds its note. The Extended Look shows it cruising top-down along the coast.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20S%C3%A9rie%206%20E64","reelNom":"BMW 6 Series E64","search":"ubermacht zion cabrio bmw 6 series e64","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-zion-cabrio.svg"},{"id":"grotti-furia","nom":"Furia","marque":"Grotti","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"Ferrari 488 Pista and SF90 Stradale","src":"First trailer","search":"grotti furia ferrari 488 pista and sf90 stradale","txt":"The Furia is modeled on the Ferrari SF90 Stradale, the first plug-in hybrid road-going Ferrari. The layout is unusual: a turbo V8 in the back, three electric motors, two of them on the front axle, for a combined total of over a thousand horsepower. It’s a car that can glide along in silence before turning into something else. The first trailer sends it flat out down an open stretch.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20488%20Pista","reelNom":"Ferrari 488 Pista","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/grotti-furia.svg"},{"id":"lamborghini-aventador","nom":"Aventador","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"Lamborghini Aventador","src":"First trailer","txt":"The Lamborghini Aventador as is, scissor doors and naturally aspirated V12, with no in-game name or fictional manufacturer attached. Rockstar dropped it into the scenery without inventing an in-house equivalent. The first trailer shows it in traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Aventador","reelNom":"Lamborghini Aventador","search":"unknown brand aventador lamborghini aventador","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/lamborghini-aventador.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-tempesta","nom":"Tempesta","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"Lamborghini Huracán and Centenario","src":"Second trailer","search":"pegassi tempesta lamborghini huracan and centenario","txt":"The Tempesta borrows from the Lamborghini Huracán and the Centenario: mid-mounted naturally aspirated V10, all-wheel drive, faceted bodywork. The Huracán is one of the last supercars to keep a big-displacement naturally aspirated engine, which gives it a sound turbocharged engines can’t match. Some also see in it the Lotus Esprit designed in 2015 and never produced.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Hurac%C3%A1n","reelNom":"Lamborghini Huracán","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-tempesta.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-zentorno","nom":"Zentorno","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"supercar","st":"comm","insp":"Lamborghini Sesto Elemento and Veneno","txt":"Sharp-edged supercar, Y-shaped air intakes, tapered roofline. The Zentorno takes the Lamborghini design language to its most extreme form, that of limited runs of just a handful of cars.","search":"pegassi zentorno lamborghini sesto elemento and veneno","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Sesto%20Elemento","reelNom":"Lamborghini Sesto Elemento","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-zentorno.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-zorrusso","nom":"Zorrusso","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"Italdesign Zerouno","src":"First trailer","search":"pegassi zorrusso italdesign zerouno","txt":"Pegassi’s Zorrusso is linked here to the Italdesign Zerouno. This identification is still a community match. The first trailer is the appearance on record for this page, with no official name for the vehicle.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Italdesign%20Zerouno","reelNom":"Italdesign Zerouno","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-zorrusso.svg"},{"id":"progen-emerus","nom":"Emerus","marque":"Progen","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"McLaren Senna","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Progen’s track supercar, traced straight from the McLaren Senna: huge rear wing, scoops everywhere, glass panels cut right down into the lower doors. Everything is sacrificed for downforce, starting with comfort. The Extended Look leaves it parked in a garage.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=McLaren%20Senna","reelNom":"McLaren Senna","search":"progen emerus mclaren senna","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/progen-emerus.svg"},{"id":"albany-buccaneer","nom":"Buccaneer","marque":"Albany","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Fairlane, Buick Riviera","src":"First trailer","search":"albany buccaneer ford fairlane, buick riviera","txt":"The Buccaneer is the American personal luxury coupe at its most lavish. The 1966 Buick Riviera that inspires it is a strikingly designed car, with its hidden headlights and taut C-pillar line, penned by the General Motors design studio at its peak. The first trailer brings it out of a corner, rear end stepping out a little.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Fairlane","reelNom":"Ford Fairlane","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-buccaneer.svg"},{"id":"albany-buccaneer-custom","nom":"Buccaneer Custom","marque":"Albany","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Fairlane, Buick Riviera","src":"First trailer","search":"albany buccaneer custom ford fairlane, buick riviera","txt":"Custom version of the Buccaneer, lowrider style: body slammed to the ground, wire wheels, metal-flake paint. The big coupes of the 60s are the historic bases of this culture, precisely because their body-on-frame chassis take hydraulic suspension well. The first trailer catches it under the neon lights of a gas station.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-028"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-028":"Light blue lowrider in the right foreground, GTA VI first trailer at 00:28"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Fairlane","reelNom":"Ford Fairlane","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-028-480.webp"},{"id":"albany-virgo-classic","nom":"Virgo Classic","marque":"Albany","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Lincoln Continental Mark III","txt":"70s personal luxury coupe: faux spare tire on the trunk, upright grille, vinyl roof. The database links this Virgo Classic to Albany and matches it to the Lincoln Continental Mark III.","search":"albany virgo classic lincoln continental mark iii","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Continental%20Mark%20III","reelNom":"Lincoln Continental Mark III","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-virgo-classic.svg"},{"id":"bravado-buffalo-stx","nom":"Buffalo STX","marque":"Bravado","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"2015 Dodge Charger","src":"First trailer","search":"bravado buffalo stx 2015 dodge charger","txt":"Sporty version of the Buffalo, with the full kit: front splitter, spoiler, exposed exhausts. It’s the archetypal American sedan that refuses to be sensible. The first trailer lines it up in a parking lot shot, doors closed.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2015%20Dodge%20Charger","reelNom":"2015 Dodge Charger","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-buffalo-stx.svg"},{"id":"bravado-gauntlet-classic","nom":"Gauntlet Classic","marque":"Bravado","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","src":"First trailer","insp":"First-generation Dodge Challenger","txt":"The original Gauntlet, modeled on the first-generation Dodge Challenger: endless hood, pronounced arches, cut-off tail. It has been Bravado’s go-to muscle car for several installments. The first trailer shows it driving down a palm-lined avenue.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Challenger","reelNom":"Dodge Challenger","search":"bravado gauntlet classic dodge challenger first generation","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-gauntlet-classic.svg"},{"id":"vapid-gauntlet-classic-custom","nom":"Gauntlet Classic Custom","marque":"Bravado","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Dodge Challenger 1970","src":"Community match","search":"bravado gauntlet classic custom dodge challenger 1970","txt":"A custom build of a 1970 Dodge Challenger, one of the most sought-after muscle cars today. The 1970 version is the one whose design everyone agrees on, with its quad-headlight grille and straight shoulder line. The Custom suffix implies a reworked engine and chassis. Not confirmed by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Challenger%201970","reelNom":"Dodge Challenger 1970","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-gauntlet-classic-custom.svg"},{"id":"bravado-gauntlet-hellfire","nom":"Gauntlet Hellfire","marque":"Bravado","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Challenger Demon 2018","src":"First trailer","search":"bravado gauntlet hellfire dodge challenger demon 2018","txt":"The Gauntlet Hellfire borrows the styling cues of the Dodge Challenger SRT Hellcat, a car whose spec sheet borders on provocation: a supercharged V8 with over seven hundred horsepower in a body designed in 1970, with no pretense of subtlety. It has become a symbol of America’s rejection of restraint. The first trailer lets it loose on a straight, hood shaking.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Challenger%20Demon%202018","reelNom":"Dodge Challenger Demon 2018","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-gauntlet-hellfire.svg"},{"id":"declasse-impaler-lx","nom":"Impaler ’80","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Chevrolet Impala","txt":"The stock Impaler, without the SZ’s body kit. The sixth-generation Chevrolet Impala, from the late 70s, is a huge sedan with a flat roof and straight sides, built by the hundreds of thousands for fleets as much as for families. The official screenshots frame it along a curb.","search":"declasse impaler ’80 chevrolet impala sixth generation","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["vice-city-09"],"imageAlts":{"vice-city-09":"Blue sedan in the foreground, under the Vice City overpass in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Impala","reelNom":"Chevrolet Impala","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/vice-city-09-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-impaler-sz","nom":"Impaler SZ","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"1994-1996 Chevrolet Impala SS","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse impaler sz 1994-1996 chevrolet impala ss","txt":"Declasse is the series’ Chevrolet, and the Impaler its big everyday sedan. The SZ version is its sporty take, in the spirit of street builds. The name plays on the Impala, a model found everywhere in American car culture. This Impaler SZ is tied to the official screenshots in our database; its name there is still a community identification.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Impala%20SS","reelNom":"Chevrolet Impala SS","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-impaler-sz.svg"},{"id":"declasse-sabre-turbo","nom":"Sabre Turbo","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Chevelle, Oldsmobile Cutlass","src":"First trailer","search":"declasse sabre turbo chevrolet chevelle, oldsmobile cutlass","txt":"The Sabre Turbo blends the Chevrolet Chevelle and the Oldsmobile Cutlass, two General Motors midsize cars that shared the same platform in the early 70s. It was the heyday of big V8s, brutally cut short by the 1973 oil crisis. The Turbo suffix, for its part, comes from the tuning world: these engines never had forced induction from the factory.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Chevelle","reelNom":"Chevrolet Chevelle","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-sabre-turbo.svg"},{"id":"declasse-tulip","nom":"Tulip","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"1972 Chevelle Malibu, 1972 Oldsmobile Cutlass Supreme","src":"First trailer","search":"declasse tulip 1972 chevelle malibu, 1972 oldsmobile cutlass supreme","txt":"The Tulip borrows from the 1972 Chevelle Malibu and Oldsmobile Cutlass Supreme, the last model year before emissions rules came to choke American engines. These midsize cars sold by the millions, which explains why you still see them everywhere, often in rough shape. It’s a neighborhood car, not a collector’s car.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-071"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-071":"Red sedan driven by Jason with Lucia, seen in profile in the GTA VI first trailer around 01:11"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1972%20Chevelle%20Malibu","reelNom":"1972 Chevelle Malibu","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-071-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-tulip-m100","nom":"Tulip M100","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Chevrolet Malibu","src":"First trailer","search":"declasse tulip m100 chevrolet malibu fourth generation","txt":"Custom version of the Tulip, in the spirit of neighborhood muscle cars: swapped engine, reworked suspension, unapologetic looks. The M100 suffix echoes the chassis codes tuners use to refer to their base cars. The first trailer parks it beside a suburban house.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-028"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-028":"Lifted pink sedan in the center, GTA VI first trailer at 00:28"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Malibu","reelNom":"Chevrolet Malibu","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-028-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-vigero-zx-convertible","nom":"Vigero ZX Convertible","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Chevrolet Camaro","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse vigero zx convertible chevrolet camaro sixth generation","txt":"Convertible version of the modern Vigero, modeled on the current Chevrolet Camaro. The current Camaro deliberately copies the proportions of the 1969 generation, with a high beltline that badly limits visibility, a trade-off fully embraced for the sake of style. The official screenshots show it top-down under a clear sky.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Camaro","reelNom":"Chevrolet Camaro","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-vigero-zx-convertible.svg"},{"id":"declasse-voodoo","nom":"Voodoo","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Chevrolet Impala 1960","txt":"Grand Theft Auto’s signature lowrider, around since San Andreas. Lowered body, hydraulic suspension, metallic paint. It feels right at home in a hot city full of wide boulevards.","search":"declasse voodoo chevrolet impala 1960","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Impala%201960","reelNom":"Chevrolet Impala 1960","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-voodoo.svg"},{"id":"imponte-phoenix","nom":"Phoenix","marque":"Imponte","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Pontiac Firebird","src":"Second trailer","search":"imponte phoenix pontiac firebird second generation","txt":"Imponte is the Pontiac of the GTA universe, a brand that no longer exists in real life but remains central to American car lore. The Phoenix borrows the styling cues of the 70s Firebird, with its huge hood and bird decal. The second trailer frames it from a low angle, rear spoiler included.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pontiac%20Firebird","reelNom":"Pontiac Firebird","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/imponte-phoenix.svg"},{"id":"imponte-ruiner","nom":"Ruiner","marque":"Imponte","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Pontiac Trans Am/Chevrolet Camaro","src":"First trailer","search":"imponte ruiner pontiac trans am/chevrolet camaro","txt":"The Ruiner is the series’ Pontiac Trans Am, a car inseparable from 70s and 80s American pop culture, made famous by movies and TV. Its silhouette, scoops and hood stripes did more for its reputation than its actual performance. The first trailer sends it tearing through an intersection.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pontiac%20Trans%20Am%2FChevrolet%20Camaro","reelNom":"Pontiac Trans Am/Chevrolet Camaro","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/imponte-ruiner.svg"},{"id":"sirius","nom":"Sirius","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"1970 Mercury Cougar","src":"Ultimate Edition","note":"The Sirius name can be read on the rear fender of the turquoise muscle car in the Wyman collection.","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"unknown brand sirius 1970 mercury cougar","txt":"The official screenshots show a turquoise muscle car with gold stripes, a trunk spoiler and three-spoke wheels, with the Sirius name spelled out in full on the rear fender. Neither our previous list nor those of other sites mentioned this model: it’s a find straight from Rockstar’s material. The silhouette is that of a 1970 Mercury Cougar, the Mustang’s pricier cousin. The manufacturer hasn’t been announced.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["classic-car-collection-02"],"vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1970%20Mercury%20Cougar","reelNom":"1970 Mercury Cougar","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/classic-car-collection-02-480.webp"},{"id":"schyster-deviant","nom":"Deviant","marque":"Schyster","cat":"muscle","st":"officiel","insp":"1972 AMC Javelin","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"schyster deviant 1972 amc javelin","txt":"The Deviant’s name comes from Rockstar, via the Ultimate Edition presentation, and our official screenshot shows it dressed in the colors of the American flag, with the cursive script badge on the C-pillar and the interior visible through the window. The AMC Javelin whose proportions it borrows was the market underdog: built by an independent automaker much smaller than Detroit’s Big Three, it still won the Trans-Am championship against the Mustangs and Camaros.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["classic-car-collection-06"],"vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1972%20AMC%20Javelin","reelNom":"1972 AMC Javelin","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/classic-car-collection-06-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-chino","nom":"Chino","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"1965 Lincoln Continental and Chrysler Imperial","src":"First trailer","search":"vapid chino 1965 lincoln continental and chrysler imperial","txt":"The Chino is the secondhand American coupe, the one you buy for next to nothing and keep for twenty years. In the series, it’s associated with working-class neighborhoods and lowrider culture. Its appeal lies less in its qualities than in what it stands for. Its presence is based on player sightings.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Continental","reelNom":"Lincoln Continental","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-chino.svg"},{"id":"vapid-chino-custom","nom":"Chino Custom","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Lincoln Continental Mark IV and V, lowrider build","src":"Community match","search":"vapid chino custom lincoln continental mark iv and v, lowrider build","txt":"Custom version of the Chino: hydraulic suspension, wire wheels, multi-layer paint. In Vice City, this look isn’t a decorative detail but a marker of belonging, inherited from Miami’s Cuban and Puerto Rican communities. Model not confirmed by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Continental%20Mark%20IV","reelNom":"Lincoln Continental Mark IV","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-chino-custom.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator","nom":"Dominator","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Mustang","src":"First trailer","search":"vapid dominator ford mustang","txt":"The Dominator is the series’ Ford Mustang, and Vapid is its Ford. The modern Mustang carries on a line started in 1964, with one constant: a big engine up front, rear-wheel drive, and a deliberately affordable price. It’s logged in the first trailer, with no name given by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang","reelNom":"Ford Mustang","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-67","nom":"Dominator ’67","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","src":"Official screenshots","insp":"First-generation Ford Mustang","txt":"The Dominator in its original form, that of the first-generation Ford Mustang: wide grille, scalloped sides, short tail. It’s the ancestor of the whole line, in road trim rather than as a lifted buggy. The official screenshots place it in a private collection.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang","reelNom":"Ford Mustang","search":"vapid dominator ’67 ford mustang first generation","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator-67.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-asp","nom":"Dominator ASP","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Mustang SVT Cobra R (New Edge)","src":"First trailer","search":"vapid dominator asp ford mustang svt cobra r (new edge)","txt":"Tuned version of the Dominator, with aero downforce parts and a wider track. Ford has always spun the Mustang off into more and more extreme versions, all the way to models that are barely street-legal. The first trailer has it glued to another car’s bumper.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang%20SVT%20Cobra%20R%20(New%20Edge)","reelNom":"Ford Mustang SVT Cobra R (New Edge)","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator-asp.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-buggy","nom":"Dominator Buggy ’67","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"officiel","insp":"1967 Ford Mustang, off-road build","src":"Official Ultimate Edition page","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"vapid dominator buggy ’67 1967 ford mustang, off-road build","txt":"Rockstar named this vehicle in the Ultimate Edition presentation, and our four official screenshots show it from every angle: blue body with a yellow stripe, number 6, tractor tires, roof bar with four spotlights, mesh grille behind a bull bar. The interior keeps the original three-spoke steering wheel and speedometer. A 1967 Ford Mustang lifted and built for mud: on its own it sums up rural swamp Florida, a few miles from the towers of Vice City.","medias":["67-vapid-dominator-buggy-01","67-vapid-dominator-buggy-02","67-vapid-dominator-buggy-03","67-vapid-dominator-buggy-04"],"edition":"Ultimate Edition","vuesDeclarees":["face","profil","interieur","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang%20de%201967","reelNom":"1967 Ford Mustang","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/67-vapid-dominator-buggy-01-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-gt","nom":"Dominator GT","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"2018-2023 Ford Mustang Convertible","src":"Official screenshots","search":"vapid dominator gt 2018-2023 ford mustang convertible","txt":"Convertible version of the Dominator. The Mustang convertible has existed since the very first generation and makes up a big share of sales in Florida, where the climate makes a roof almost unnecessary. The official screenshots set it in front of a seaside villa.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang%20Convertible","reelNom":"Ford Mustang Convertible","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator-gt.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-gtx","nom":"Dominator GTX","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Modern Ford Mustang and Dodge Charger","src":"First trailer","search":"vapid dominator gtx modern ford mustang and dodge charger","txt":"Another version of the Dominator, in the vein of the special editions Ford keeps piling onto the Mustang: commemorative liveries, reworked engines, numbered limited runs. The Dominator GTX is logged in the first trailer under a name suggested by the community.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang","reelNom":"Ford Mustang","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator-gtx.svg"},{"id":"vapid-slamvan","nom":"Slamvan","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford F-Series 1953-1956, rat rod build","src":"First trailer","search":"vapid slamvan ford f-series 1953-1956 rat rod build","txt":"The Slamvan is a pickup slammed to the ground, halfway between a custom build and a show vehicle. Lowered trucks are a California and Texas tradition, born in the 80s around Japanese mini-trucks. The version listed here is tied to the first trailer, with no official name given.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-Series%20pr%C3%A9par%C3%A9%20rat%20rod","reelNom":"Ford F-Series, rat rod build","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-slamvan.svg"},{"id":"willard-faction","nom":"Faction","marque":"Willard","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"80s Buick Regal","txt":"A late-80s American two-door coupe, the series’ classic lowrider base. Straight lines, thick C-pillar, slim grille.","search":"willard faction 80s buick regal","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Regal%20des%20ann%C3%A9es%2080","reelNom":"80s Buick Regal","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/willard-faction.svg"},{"id":"willard-faction-custom-donk","nom":"Faction Custom Donk","marque":"Willard","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Buick Regal, donk build","txt":"The donk is a customization style born in the American South, especially in Miami: raised body, huge-diameter rims, loud paint. It’s one of the few car styles truly rooted in the region Leonida represents.","search":"willard faction custom donk buick regal donk build","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Regal%20en%20configuration%20donk","reelNom":"Buick Regal, donk build","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/willard-faction-custom-donk.svg"},{"id":"albany-cavalcade-xl","nom":"Cavalcade XL","marque":"Albany","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Cadillac Escalade-V 2023","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The American luxury SUV at its showiest. The Escalade-V whose looks it borrows packs a supercharged six-liter V8 into a body weighing two and a half tons. It’s the ultimate status vehicle, the one for motorcades and music videos.","search":"albany cavalcade xl cadillac escalade-v 2023","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cadillac%20Escalade-V%202023","reelNom":"Cadillac Escalade-V 2023","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-cavalcade-xl.svg"},{"id":"benefactor-dubsta","nom":"Dubsta","marque":"Benefactor","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz G-Class","src":"First trailer","search":"benefactor dubsta mercedes-benz g-class","txt":"The Dubsta borrows the styling cues of the Mercedes-Benz G-Class, a vehicle originally designed for the military that stayed in production almost unchanged for forty years. Its success comes down to a paradox: a military machine turned urban luxury item, sold for a fortune in neighborhoods where it will never tackle any terrain at all. The first trailer has it climbing a curb, bumper first.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20G-Class","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz G-Class","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/benefactor-dubsta.svg"},{"id":"benefactor-xls","nom":"XLS","marque":"Benefactor","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz GL-Class","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Big three-row German SUV, somewhere between the Mercedes GL and the BMW X5. Spotted in the Extended Look. It’s the executive SUV format, long enough for seven seats and plush enough to never leave the pavement.","search":"benefactor xls mercedes-benz gl-class","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Classe%20GL","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz GL-Class","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/benefactor-xls.svg"},{"id":"bravado-dorado","nom":"Dorado","marque":"Bravado","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"First-generation Dodge Durango","src":"Official screenshots","search":"bravado dorado dodge durango first generation","txt":"The Dorado is modeled on the first-generation Dodge Durango, released in 1998 on a Dakota pickup base. It was Chrysler’s answer to the American market’s shift toward the family SUV: three rows of seats, towing capacity, and fuel consumption nobody was looking at yet.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Durango","reelNom":"Dodge Durango","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-dorado.svg"},{"id":"enus-jubilee","nom":"Jubilee","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Rolls-Royce Cullinan","src":"First trailer","search":"buckingham jubilee rolls-royce cullinan","txt":"The Jubilee is the lineup’s ultra-luxury SUV, modeled on the Rolls-Royce Cullinan. Its arrival in the real world marked a turning point: a brand that had historically refused to build off-roaders got into it because they became its main source of profit. Coach doors, upright grille, unapologetic ride height.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rolls-Royce%20Cullinan","reelNom":"Rolls-Royce Cullinan","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/enus-jubilee.svg"},{"id":"canis-mesa","nom":"Mesa","marque":"Canis","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Jeep Wrangler","src":"Official Ultimate Edition image","note":"The Canis badge can be read on the grille of the green pickup shown in the One-Eyed Willie shop.","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"canis mesa jeep wrangler","txt":"Our official screenshots show this bright green four-door pickup in the One-Eyed Willie shop, with the Canis badge spelled out in full on the grille, a winch, tow hooks and a skid plate under the engine. A shop view shows it with the hood open, mid-build. The silhouette recalls Jeep-style ladder-frame off-roaders. The model isn’t named by Rockstar.","vuesDeclarees":["face","profil","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Wrangler","reelNom":"Jeep Wrangler","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/canis-mesa.svg"},{"id":"declasse-seminole-frontier","nom":"Seminole Frontier","marque":"Canis","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Jeep Cherokee XJ","txt":"Compact SUV with a boxy body, flat wheel arches, upright C-pillar. The name refers to Florida’s Seminole people, whose historic territory covers part of what the game calls Leonida.","search":"canis seminole frontier jeep cherokee xj second generation","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Cherokee%20XJ","reelNom":"Jeep Cherokee XJ","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-seminole-frontier.svg"},{"id":"canis-terminus","nom":"Terminus","marque":"Canis","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Jeep Wrangler Rubicon","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Short off-roader with an exposed roll cage, modeled on the current Wrangler Rubicon. The Wrangler is still one of the few mainstream 4x4s to keep solid axles and a removable roof, which explains why it’s in every Florida wetland. Seen in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Wrangler%20Rubicon","reelNom":"Jeep Wrangler Rubicon","search":"canis terminus jeep wrangler rubicon fourth generation","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/canis-terminus.svg"},{"id":"declasse-granger","nom":"Granger","marque":"Declasse","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Suburban","src":"Second trailer","search":"declasse granger chevrolet suburban","txt":"The Granger is the big body-on-frame American SUV, modeled on the Chevrolet Suburban. This type of vehicle holds a special place in the United States: family car, work vehicle, law enforcement cruiser, all at once. It appears in the second trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Suburban","reelNom":"Chevrolet Suburban","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-granger.svg"},{"id":"declasse-granger-3600lx","nom":"Granger 3600LX","marque":"Declasse","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Suburban 2015-2020","src":"First trailer","search":"declasse granger 3600lx chevrolet suburban 2015-2020","txt":"High-end version of the Granger, in the spirit of the luxury trims General Motors layers onto its big SUVs: leather, chrome, twenty-two-inch rims. The vehicle is visible in the first trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Suburban","reelNom":"Chevrolet Suburban","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-granger-3600lx.svg"},{"id":"dundreary-landstalker-xl","nom":"Landstalker XL","marque":"Dundreary","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Lincoln Navigator","src":"Second trailer","search":"dundreary landstalker xl lincoln navigator fourth generation","txt":"The Landstalker XL is based on the fourth-generation Lincoln Navigator, the big American luxury SUV at its most imposing. Lincoln took the living-room-on-wheels idea all the way: three rows, leather trim, panoramic screen. It’s the vehicle of Vice City’s wealthy neighborhoods, the one you pull up in front of the hotel without even getting out.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Navigator","reelNom":"Lincoln Navigator","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dundreary-landstalker-xl.svg"},{"id":"gallivanter-baller","nom":"Baller II","marque":"Gallivanter","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Range Rover Evoque and Range Rover Sport","src":"Official screenshots","search":"gallivanter baller ii range rover evoque and range rover sport","txt":"Gallivanter is the Land Rover of the GTA universe, and the Baller its city-focused version, based on the Range Rover Sport. The real-world model shows a telling shift: starting out as a British farm utility vehicle, it became the go-to vehicle of wealthy neighborhoods, with off-road abilities nobody ever uses.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Range%20Rover%20Evoque","reelNom":"Range Rover Evoque","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/gallivanter-baller.svg"},{"id":"gallivanter-baller-st","nom":"Baller ST-D","marque":"Gallivanter","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Range Rover L460","txt":"The performance version of the Baller: redesigned bumper, quad exhaust tips, large-diameter rims. The fast luxury SUV is an archetype right at home in Vice City’s wealthy neighborhoods.","search":"gallivanter baller st-d range rover l460","src":"Official screenshots","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Range%20Rover%20L460","reelNom":"Range Rover L460","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/gallivanter-baller-st.svg"},{"id":"vapid-contender","nom":"Contender","marque":"Karin","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Ford F-150 Raptor and modified Toyota Tundra","src":"Official screenshots","search":"karin contender ford f-150 raptor and modified toyota tundra","txt":"Full-size pickup modeled on the modified Toyota Tundra, with touches of the Ford F-150 Raptor: the lifted leisure truck category, made for dirt trails more than the city. The official screenshots show it perched on its knobby tires.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-150%20Raptor","reelNom":"Ford F-150 Raptor","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-contender.svg"},{"id":"karin-vivanite","nom":"Vivanite","marque":"Karin","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Toyota Sienna","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Japanese minivan spotted in the Extended Look. The Sienna whose lines it borrows went hybrid as standard, a rare choice in this segment. With Karin being the Toyota of the GTA universe, the lineage is clear.","search":"karin vivanite toyota sienna fourth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20Sienna","reelNom":"Toyota Sienna","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-vivanite.svg"},{"id":"lampadati-novak","nom":"Novak","marque":"Lampadati","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Maserati Levante","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Italian luxury SUV, somewhere between the Maserati Levante and the Alfa Romeo Stelvio. Lampadati covers both of these brands in the GTA universe. The challenge is to fit a sports sedan’s character into a raised body, with debatable results.","search":"lampadati novak maserati levante","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Maserati%20Levante","reelNom":"Maserati Levante","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/lampadati-novak.svg"},{"id":"mammoth-patriot-mil-spec","nom":"Patriot Mil-Spec","marque":"Mammoth","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Hummer H1","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Military version of the Patriot, modeled on the civilian Hummer H1 derived from the US Army’s Humvee. Wide, slow, thirsty, it never had any selling point other than its go-anywhere ability and its looks. Spotted in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Hummer%20H1","reelNom":"Hummer H1","search":"mammoth patriot mil-spec hummer h1","thumb":"/img/schemas/mammoth-patriot-mil-spec.svg"},{"id":"dodge-durango-3","nom":"Durango","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Third-generation Dodge Durango","src":"Second trailer","txt":"Third-generation American family SUV, offered with engines that are anything but family-friendly in its most powerful versions. Separate from the Dorado, which is based on the first generation. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand durango dodge durango third generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Durango","reelNom":"Dodge Durango","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dodge-durango-3.svg"},{"id":"ford-explorer-2","nom":"Explorer ’95","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Ford Explorer","src":"First trailer","txt":"The SUV that tipped the American market. The second-generation Explorer, sold by the millions in the 90s, convinced families to give up the station wagon. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand explorer ’95 ford explorer second generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer","reelNom":"Ford Explorer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-explorer-2.svg"},{"id":"audi-q7-2","nom":"Q7","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Audi Q7","src":"First trailer","txt":"Big three-row German SUV, second generation. The Audi Q7 kicked off a lineup at the brand that now makes up most of its sales, at the expense of the sedans that built its reputation. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand q7 audi q7 second generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20Q7","reelNom":"Audi Q7","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/audi-q7-2.svg"},{"id":"toyota-rav4-5","nom":"RAV4","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fifth-generation Toyota RAV4","src":"Second trailer","txt":"Japanese compact SUV, the best-selling vehicle in the world across all categories for several years. Its presence in Leonida’s traffic is simply statistical realism. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand rav4 toyota rav4 fifth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20RAV4","reelNom":"Toyota RAV4","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/toyota-rav4-5.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-toros","nom":"Toros","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Lamborghini Urus and Audi Q8","src":"Official screenshots","search":"pegassi toros lamborghini urus and audi q8","txt":"The Toros transposes the Lamborghini Urus formula: an SUV built on a mass-production base, dressed in the brand’s styling cues and fitted with an extreme powertrain. Commercially, it’s the model that let Lamborghini double its production. It appears in the official screenshots.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Urus","reelNom":"Lamborghini Urus","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-toros.svg"},{"id":"pfister-astron","nom":"Astron","marque":"Pfister","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Porsche Macan","src":"Second trailer","search":"pfister astron porsche macan","txt":"The Astron is Pfister’s SUV, modeled on the Porsche Macan, the Cayenne’s little brother. The Cayenne caused an uproar among the brand’s purists at its 2002 launch, before becoming the model that paid to keep the sports cars in the lineup. Rockstar let it appear in the second trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20Macan","reelNom":"Porsche Macan","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pfister-astron.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-rebla-gts","nom":"Rebla GTS","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation BMW X5","txt":"German coupe SUV, sloping roofline and raked tailgate. The Rebla fills the niche of the SUV trying to look like a sports sedan, a niche invented by the very model that inspires it.","search":"ubermacht rebla gts bmw x5 fourth generation","src":"Extended Look","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20X5","reelNom":"BMW X5","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-rebla-gts.svg"},{"id":"vapid-aleutian","nom":"Aleutian","marque":"Vapid","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Ford Expedition","src":"Second trailer","search":"vapid aleutian ford expedition fourth generation","txt":"A big American SUV with three rows of seats, the Aleutian belongs to the class of vehicles designed to carry seven people and their luggage over long highway distances. The second trailer parks it in a residential driveway, tailgate up.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Expedition","reelNom":"Ford Expedition","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-aleutian.svg"},{"id":"vapid-montagne","nom":"Montagne","marque":"Vapid","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Ford Explorer","src":"Second trailer","txt":"The modern Explorer, back to rear-wheel drive after twenty years of front-wheel drive. With Vapid being the Ford of the GTA universe, the attribution is straightforward. It’s the most common American police SUV today, and it also shows up in civilian trim.","search":"vapid montagne ford explorer sixth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer","reelNom":"Ford Explorer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-montagne.svg"},{"id":"vapid-riata-classic","nom":"Riata Classic","marque":"Vapid","cat":"suv","st":"officiel","insp":"First-generation Ford Bronco","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"vapid riata classic ford bronco first generation","txt":"Rockstar names the Riata Classic in passing in the Ultimate Edition, and our official screenshot shows it in profile: cream body, red-to-yellow gradient side stripes, all-terrain tires, cursive script badge on the fender. The first-generation Ford Bronco whose look it borrows was a simple utility vehicle, little more than a chassis and a body, and has since become a sought-after collectible.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["classic-car-collection-03"],"vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Bronco","reelNom":"Ford Bronco","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/classic-car-collection-03-480.webp"},{"id":"annis-hellion","nom":"Hellion","marque":"Annis","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Nissan Patrol Safari Y6, Jeep Cherokee (XJ)","src":"First trailer","search":"annis hellion nissan patrol safari y6, jeep cherokee (xj)","txt":"The Hellion is Annis’s off-roader, which is unusual for a brand associated with Japanese sports cars. Its compact, boxy silhouette recalls the Japanese 4x4s of the 80s, built for crawling over obstacles rather than for comfort. It shows up on screen in the first trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Nissan%20Patrol%20Safari%20Y6","reelNom":"Nissan Patrol Safari Y6","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/annis-hellion.svg"},{"id":"bravado-bison-900-95-monster-truck","nom":"Bison 900 ’95 Monster Truck","marque":"Bravado","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Dodge Ram, monster truck build","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The Bison 900 ’95 mounted on raised axles and tractor tires. The monster truck was born in the southern United States in the late 70s, when pickup owners started stacking up wheel sizes until it became a show. Florida has several tracks for them.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Ram%20en%20configuration%20monster%20truck","reelNom":"Dodge Ram, monster truck build","search":"bravado bison 900 ’95 monster truck dodge ram second generation monster truck build","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-bison-900-95-monster-truck.svg"},{"id":"canis-kamacho","nom":"Kamacho","marque":"Canis","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Jeep Crew Chief 715 concept","txt":"Off-roader with cut-away bodywork and knobby tires, designed for off-trail driving. The swamps and backcountry trails of Leonida give it a real purpose rather than a decorative one.","search":"canis kamacho jeep crew chief 715 concept","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["one-eyed-willie-s-mod-shop-01","ultimate-edition-one-eyed-willie-03"],"imageAlts":{"one-eyed-willie-s-mod-shop-01":"Green Canis pickup built up at One-Eyed Willie’s in GTA VI.","ultimate-edition-one-eyed-willie-03":"Green Canis pickup in the One-Eyed Willie shop in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Crew%20Chief%20715%20concept","reelNom":"Jeep Crew Chief 715 concept","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/one-eyed-willie-s-mod-shop-01-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-rancher","nom":"Rancher","marque":"Declasse","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Suburban","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse rancher chevrolet suburban","txt":"The Rancher is an old-school utility off-roader, closer to farm equipment than to a leisure vehicle. In the series, it’s associated with rural areas, which fits the swamps and farms of northern Leonida. Present in the screenshots released by Rockstar.","medias":["trailer-2-rancher-035"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-rancher-035":"Red and white pickup, with two passengers in the bed, ahead of Jason’s car on the expressway, GTA VI second trailer around 00:35."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Suburban","reelNom":"Chevrolet Suburban","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-rancher-035-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-walton-l35-stock","nom":"Walton L35","marque":"Declasse","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet S-10 1991-1993","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse walton l35 chevrolet s-10 1991-1993","txt":"Small old-school work pickup, single cab and short bed. The Chevrolet S-10 of the early 90s was the cheapest compact truck on the American market, sold to tradespeople and farms. Its value has been climbing since the category disappeared from showrooms.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20S-10","reelNom":"Chevrolet S-10","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-walton-l35-stock.svg"},{"id":"declasse-yosemite","nom":"Yosemite","marque":"Declasse","cat":"pickup","st":"comm","insp":"Chevrolet C10 from the 60s","txt":"Classic single-cab American pickup, often restored as a collector vehicle. The 1500 variant is already in this database.","search":"declasse yosemite chevrolet c10 from the 60s","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20C10%20des%20ann%C3%A9es%2060","reelNom":"Chevrolet C10 from the 60s","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-yosemite.svg"},{"id":"declasse-yosemite-1500","nom":"Yosemite 1500","marque":"Declasse","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"First-generation Chevrolet Silverado","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse yosemite 1500 chevrolet silverado first generation","txt":"The Yosemite 1500 follows the first-generation Chevrolet Silverado, launched in 1999 to replace the C/K. It’s the pickup that tipped the category toward sedan-like comfort: extended cab, four doors, chrome trim. It appears in the official screenshots.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Silverado","reelNom":"Chevrolet Silverado","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-yosemite-1500.svg"},{"id":"dinka-verus","nom":"Verus","marque":"Dinka","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Polaris Sportsman MV850","txt":"Off-road quad, tube frame and wide tires. The vehicle for sandy trails and places no car can get through.","search":"dinka verus polaris sportsman mv850","src":"Official screenshots","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Polaris%20Sportsman%20MV850","reelNom":"Polaris Sportsman MV850","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-verus.svg"},{"id":"bravado-rebel","nom":"Rebel","marque":"Karin","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Toyota Hilux","src":"Official screenshots","search":"karin rebel toyota hilux","txt":"The Rebel is modeled on the Toyota Hilux, a pickup so famous for being indestructible that it became the go-to vehicle for war zones and expeditions. Its mechanical simplicity is exactly what makes it valuable. It shows up in the official screenshots.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20Hilux","reelNom":"Toyota Hilux","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-rebel.svg"},{"id":"dodge-dakota-convertible","nom":"Dakota Convertible","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Dakota Convertible","src":"First trailer","txt":"An automotive oddity: a convertible pickup, built by Dodge in just a few thousand units in the late 80s. The idea never caught on, which makes it an unlikely collectible today. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand dakota convertible dodge dakota convertible","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Dakota%20Convertible","reelNom":"Dodge Dakota Convertible","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dodge-dakota-convertible.svg"},{"id":"ford-explorer-sport-trac","nom":"Explorer Sport Trac","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","src":"Extended Look","insp":"Ford Explorer Sport Trac","txt":"The Ford Explorer Sport Trac, that short-bed SUV caught between station wagon and pickup, in its civilian version. It’s the same chassis as the one in lifeguard livery, with a stock body. The Extended Look leaves it parked in a beachside parking lot.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer%20Sport%20Trac","reelNom":"Ford Explorer Sport Trac","search":"unknown brand explorer sport trac ford explorer sport trac","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-explorer-sport-trac.svg"},{"id":"ford-f-series-3","nom":"F-Series ’50","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Third-generation Ford F-Series","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"50s Ford pickup, third generation, the one with wide grilles and rounded fenders. It’s the silhouette you associate with farms and gas stations of that era, and a base highly sought after by builders. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand f-series ’50 ford f-series third generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-Series","reelNom":"Ford F-Series","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-f-series-3.svg"},{"id":"ram-3500","nom":"RAM 3500","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"RAM 3500","src":"First trailer","txt":"Heavy-duty pickup with dual rear wheels, built to tow loads nothing else can. It’s the vehicle for people hauling horses, boats and campers. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand ram 3500 ram 3500","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=RAM%203500","reelNom":"RAM 3500","thumb":"/img/schemas/ram-3500.svg"},{"id":"jeep-scrambler-cj8","nom":"Scrambler CJ-8","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Jeep Scrambler CJ-8","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Long-wheelbase Jeep CJ with a small bed in the back, built from 1981 to 1986. A slow seller back then, it has become a cult object among off-road fans. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand scrambler cj-8 jeep scrambler cj-8","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Scrambler%20CJ-8","reelNom":"Jeep Scrambler CJ-8","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/jeep-scrambler-cj8.svg"},{"id":"swamp-buggy","nom":"Swamp Buggy","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Palm Beach swamp buggy","src":"First trailer","txt":"Swamp machine riding on giant wheels, a South Florida specialty. Swamp buggies have been raced there since the 40s, in muddy pits rather than on a track. Glimpsed in the first trailer. Its in-game name hasn’t been announced.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Swamp%20buggy%20de%20Palm%20Beach","reelNom":"Palm Beach swamp buggy","search":"unknown brand swamp buggy palm beach swamp buggy","thumb":"/img/schemas/swamp-buggy.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-blazer","nom":"Blazer","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Yamaha YFZ450","src":"First trailer","search":"nagasaki blazer yamaha yfz450","txt":"The Blazer is a recreational quad, a four-wheeled vehicle with handlebars built for sand and trails. Florida, with its beaches and forest trails, is one of the most active markets for this kind of machine. The quad crosses several shots in the first trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yamaha%20YFZ450","reelNom":"Yamaha YFZ450","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-blazer.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-outlaw","nom":"Outlaw","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Can-Am Maverick X3 Turbo","src":"First trailer","search":"nagasaki outlaw can-am maverick x3 turbo","txt":"An off-road buggy with a tube frame, the Outlaw sits between a quad and a car: full roll cage, two side-by-side seats, long-travel suspension. The buggy appears in the first trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Can-Am%20Maverick%20X3%20Turbo","reelNom":"Can-Am Maverick X3 Turbo","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-outlaw.svg"},{"id":"vapid-caracara","nom":"Caracara","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Ford F-150, Hennessey VelociRaptor 6X6","txt":"The base version of the Caracara, before the beefed-up 4x4 version. Compact short-cab pickup, designed more for dirt trails than for the highway.","search":"vapid caracara ford f-150, hennessey velociraptor 6x6","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-150","reelNom":"Ford F-150","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-caracara.svg"},{"id":"vapid-caracara-4x4","nom":"Caracara 4x4","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Ford F-150 Raptor","src":"Second trailer","search":"vapid caracara 4x4 ford f-150 raptor second generation","txt":"The Caracara 4x4 is the game’s take on the Ford F-150 Raptor, a pickup built to go fast on dirt rather than crawl slowly over obstacles. Its long-travel suspension comes straight from Baja desert racing. It appears in the second trailer.","medias":["trailer-2-caracara-016","brian-heder-01"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-caracara-016":"Brian Heder in front of his Vapid pickup in the official Trailer 2 of GTA VI.","brian-heder-01":"Brian Heder at the wheel of his pickup in an official GTA VI screenshot."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-150%20Raptor","reelNom":"Ford F-150 Raptor","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-caracara-016-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-ganado","nom":"Ganado ’70","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Ranchero 1970, Mercury Cougar 1969-1970","src":"Official screenshots","note":"The Ganado name and the 434ci marking can be read on the car-based pickup parked outside Jason’s safehouse.","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"vapid ganado ’70 creado ford ranchero 1970, mercury cougar 1969-1970","txt":"Our official screenshots show this yellow car-based pickup with red stripes outside Jason’s safehouse, in the Keys. The Ganado name can be read on the fender and on the dashboard, along with the 434ci marking, which gives the displacement in cubic inches. It’s a coupe utility in the vein of the Ford Ranchero, and where it sits in Rockstar’s material suggests it belongs to the character. Rockstar has since tied the model to Vapid, after first presenting it under the name Creado.","fam":"70s American coupe utility","alias":"Creado","medias":["ganado-retro-build","jason-s-safehouse-vehicles"],"perso":"jason","vuesDeclarees":["profil","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Ranchero%201970","reelNom":"Ford Ranchero 1970","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/ganado-retro-build-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-liberator","nom":"Liberator","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Ford Expedition, monster truck build","src":"First trailer","txt":"Monster truck with a patriotic paint job, recognizable from the first trailer on. Its base is a big Ford SUV perched on truck axles. This kind of machine almost never drives on the road: it lives on a trailer between shows, and that’s exactly the kind of detail Rockstar loves to twist.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Expedition%20en%20monster%20truck","reelNom":"Ford Expedition, monster truck build","search":"vapid liberator ford expedition second generation monster truck build","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-liberator.svg"},{"id":"vapid-reclaimer","nom":"Reclaimer","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Ranger T6 2019-2023","src":"First trailer","txt":"Midsize pickup, the format that has won back market share in the United States from full-size trucks that grew enormous. This generation of Ranger was sold as the sensible compromise: enough bed to work with, compact enough to park in the city.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Ranger%20T6","reelNom":"Ford Ranger T6","search":"vapid reclaimer ford ranger t6 2019-2023","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-reclaimer.svg"},{"id":"vapid-sandking-xl","nom":"Sandking XL","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Super Duty","src":"First trailer","search":"vapid sandking xl ford super duty","txt":"The Sandking XL is a lifted pickup on oversized tires, in the spirit of modified Ford F-350s. Lifted trucks are especially common in the American South, where they’re as much about use as about making a statement. The pickup appears as early as the first trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Super%20Duty","reelNom":"Ford Super Duty","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-sandking-xl.svg"},{"id":"bravado-bison","nom":"Bison","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Dodge Ram Quad Cab","src":"Second trailer","search":"bravado bison dodge ram quad cab fourth generation","txt":"The Bison is the American work pickup in its most common form: crew cab, short bed, V8 engine. This type of vehicle has been the best-selling in the United States, across all categories, for more than forty years. It’s visible in the second trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Ram%20Quad%20Cab","reelNom":"Dodge Ram Quad Cab","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-bison.svg"},{"id":"bravado-bison-1800","nom":"Bison 1800","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Ram 1500 DT","src":"Second trailer","txt":"Modern version of the Bison, based on the DT-generation Ram 1500. Massive grille, crew cab, optional air suspension: the modern American pickup has stopped being a tool and become a raised family sedan, and the sales figures prove it right.","search":"bravado bison 1800 ram 1500 dt","medias":["grassrivers-04"],"imageAlts":{"grassrivers-04":"Pickup in the foreground during a chase through the Grassrivers swamps, GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ram%201500%20DT","reelNom":"Ram 1500 DT","thumb":"/img/officiel/grassrivers-04-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-bison-900-95","nom":"Bison 900 ’95","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Dodge Ram","src":"First trailer","txt":"The 90s version of the Bison, modeled on the second-generation Dodge Ram. This is the model that started the trend for the tall hood and big-rig-style grille, a design that swung the whole segment. Twenty years later, you still see them everywhere in the South.","search":"bravado bison 900 ’95 dodge ram second generation","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-053"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-053":"Green pickup and its occupant, official GTA VI first trailer at 00:53"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Ram","reelNom":"Dodge Ram","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-053-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-rumpo","nom":"Rumpo","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Ford E-Series","txt":"Panel van, with no rear side windows. The Rumpo has been in the series since GTA III and fills the role of the generic work van.","search":"bravado rumpo ford e-series","src":"First trailer","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-064"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-064":"White van on the left of the scene filmed by Weazel News, GTA VI first trailer around 01:04"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20E-Series","reelNom":"Ford E-Series","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-064-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-youga-classic","nom":"Youga Classic","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Ford Econoline","src":"First trailer","search":"bravado youga classic ford econoline second generation","txt":"The Youga Classic is the 70s American van, the one surfers and touring rock bands drove. This category developed a look of its own, with airbrushed murals, porthole windows and carpeted interiors. The van can be spotted in the first trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Econoline","reelNom":"Ford Econoline","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-youga-classic.svg"},{"id":"brute-boxville","nom":"Boxville","marque":"Brute","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"GMC Step Van","src":"Official screenshots","search":"brute boxville gmc step van","txt":"The Boxville is the boxy delivery van you see everywhere on American streets. Its shape makes no attempt at looks: it’s as much volume as possible set on a chassis, with a sliding door on the side. It appears in the screenshots released by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=GMC%20Step%20Van","reelNom":"GMC Step Van","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-boxville.svg"},{"id":"vapid-bobcat-xl","nom":"Bobcat XL","marque":"Declasse","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Chevrolet C/K","src":"First trailer","search":"declasse bobcat xl chevrolet c/k fourth generation","txt":"A compact short-bed pickup, the Bobcat XL fills the niche of the small all-purpose truck, the one tradespeople and city services use. Less imposing than an F-150, it stays usable in the city. The pickup appears in the first trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20C%2FK","reelNom":"Chevrolet C/K","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-bobcat-xl.svg"},{"id":"declasse-burrito","nom":"Burrito","marque":"Declasse","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Express 1996-2002","src":"First trailer","search":"declasse burrito chevrolet express 1996-2002","txt":"The Burrito is the quintessential job-site van: panel body, no rear windows, with a three-seat front bench. In the series, it’s inseparable from heists, which says a lot about how well it goes unnoticed. The van does appear in the first trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Express","reelNom":"Chevrolet Express","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-burrito.svg"},{"id":"coach","nom":"Coach","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"comm","insp":null,"src":"Community match","search":"unknown brand coach american long-distance coach","txt":"The long-distance coach is part of the American road landscape, with its side luggage bays and band of tinted windows. It connects the cities airlines ignore. Model not confirmed by Rockstar for GTA VI.","fam":"American long-distance coach","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Autocar%20longue%20distance%20am%C3%A9ricain","reelNom":"American long-distance coach","thumb":"/img/schemas/coach.svg"},{"id":"ford-econoline-4","nom":"Econoline","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Ford Econoline","src":"Second trailer","txt":"Short-nosed American van, fourth generation. The Econoline was the go-to work van in the United States for decades: plumbers, florists, touring bands. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand econoline ford econoline fourth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Econoline","reelNom":"Ford Econoline","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-econoline-4.svg"},{"id":"moocher","nom":"Moocher","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fleetwood Southwind 1985","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"80s motorhome, boxy body and period decorative stripes. The name, which roughly means freeloader, says a lot about the kind of person Rockstar pictures behind the wheel. These aging rigs often serve as permanent housing in Florida.","search":"unknown brand moocher fleetwood southwind 1985","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Fleetwood%20Southwind%201985","reelNom":"Fleetwood Southwind 1985","thumb":"/img/schemas/moocher.svg"},{"id":"rexhall-rose-air","nom":"Rose Air","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Rexhall Rose Air","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Class A motorhome spotted in the Extended Look. Rexhall was a California maker of mid-range motorhomes, now defunct. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand rose air rexhall rose air","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rexhall%20Rose%20Air","reelNom":"Rexhall Rose Air","thumb":"/img/schemas/rexhall-rose-air.svg"},{"id":"mercedes-sprinter-2","nom":"Sprinter","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz Sprinter","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Premium high-roof van, second generation. The Sprinter created a category all by itself: reliable enough for commercial fleets, roomy enough for camper conversions. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand sprinter mercedes-benz sprinter","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Sprinter","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz Sprinter","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/mercedes-sprinter-2.svg"},{"id":"chrysler-town-country","nom":"Town & Country","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Chrysler Town & Country","src":"First trailer","txt":"Family minivan with sliding doors, fifth generation. Chrysler invented this format in 1983 and dominated it for thirty years before the SUV swept it away. It’s the suburban family vehicle, everywhere and completely invisible. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand town & country chrysler town & country","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chrysler%20Town%20%26%20Country","reelNom":"Chrysler Town & Country","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chrysler-town-country.svg"},{"id":"ford-transit-4","nom":"Transit","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Ford Transit","src":"Second trailer","txt":"European van brought to the United States in the 2010s to replace the Econoline. Taller, narrower, thriftier: the European idea of the work van, which eventually won over the US. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand transit ford transit fourth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Transit","reelNom":"Ford Transit","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-transit-4.svg"},{"id":"ford-transit-cargo-4","nom":"Transit Cargo","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Transit Cargo","src":"First trailer","txt":"Panel version of the Transit, with no side windows in the back. It’s the setup delivery drivers and tradespeople use, the one that gives the most cargo space and the least view of what you’re hauling. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand transit cargo ford transit cargo","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Transit%20Cargo","reelNom":"Ford Transit Cargo","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-transit-cargo-4.svg"},{"id":"vapid-speedo","nom":"Speedo","marque":"Vapid","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Express, 2003 onward","src":"First trailer","search":"vapid speedo chevrolet express, 2003 onward","txt":"The Speedo is a compact cab-forward van, in the spirit of city work vans. Its small size makes it the go-to for downtown deliveries, where a Boxville can’t squeeze through. You can see it drive by in the first trailer.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Express","reelNom":"Chevrolet Express","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-speedo.svg"},{"id":"zirconium-journey","nom":"Journey","marque":"Zirconium","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"1979-1981 Fleetwood Pace Arrow","txt":"Class A motorhome, the vehicle of Florida retirements and East Coast road trips. The newer Journey II variant is already in this database.","search":"zirconium journey 1979-1981 fleetwood pace arrow","src":"Official screenshots","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Fleetwood%20Pace%20Arrow","reelNom":"Fleetwood Pace Arrow","thumb":"/img/schemas/zirconium-journey.svg"},{"id":"zirconium-journey-ii","nom":"Journey II","marque":"Zirconium","cat":"van","st":"comm","insp":"Winnebago Chieftain","src":"Community match","search":"zirconium journey ii winnebago chieftain","txt":"The Journey II is a Class A motorhome, modeled on the Winnebago Chieftain. The brand name, Zirconium, plays on imitation: zircon is the stone that looks like a diamond without being one. For a budget vacation vehicle, the joke lands nicely. These rigs are part of the scenery on Florida roads, especially in winter.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Winnebago%20Chieftain","reelNom":"Winnebago Chieftain","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/zirconium-journey-ii.svg"},{"id":"dinka-double-t","nom":"Double T","marque":"Dinka","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Honda CBR","src":"First trailer","search":"dinka double t honda cbr","txt":"The Double T is a faired sport-touring bike, in the line of the Honda CBR. This class of motorcycle aims for a rare balance: quick enough to be fun, comfortable enough for long rides. The first trailer is the source we list for the Double T’s appearance, though its name hasn’t been announced.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20CBR","reelNom":"Honda CBR","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-double-t.svg"},{"id":"dinka-enduro","nom":"Enduro","marque":"Dinka","cat":"moto","st":"officiel","insp":"Honda XL 350 and XR 500","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"dinka enduro honda xl 350 and xr 500","txt":"The Enduro gets its name from Rockstar’s Ultimate Edition description, and our official screenshot gives a clean side view: olive green tank with the Dinka logo, worn black seat, high fender, knobby tires, high-mounted exhaust. It’s a 1980s Japanese dual-sport, the kind that saw as much use on the road as on dirt trails. Another screenshot shows it parked outside Jason’s safehouse, which suggests it’s his.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["dinka-enduro-motorcycle","jason-s-safehouse-vehicles"],"perso":"jason","vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20XL%20350","reelNom":"Honda XL 350","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/officiel/dinka-enduro-motorcycle-480.webp"},{"id":"lcc-avarus","nom":"Avarus","marque":"LCC","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Generica mostly-naked chopper","txt":"Chopper with a heavily raked fork, high handlebars and a skinny front wheel. A style that comes straight from American motorcycle clubs, and one that feels right at home on long, straight coastal roads.","search":"lcc avarus generica mostly-naked chopper","src":"Second trailer","medias":["trailer-2-motorcycle-143"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-motorcycle-143":"Jason riding a red motorcycle in front of a seaplane in the official GTA VI Trailer 2."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Generica%20mostly-naked%20chopper","reelNom":"Generica mostly-naked chopper","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-motorcycle-143-480.webp"},{"id":"maibatsu-manchez","nom":"Manchez","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"500cc KTM","txt":"Light dual-sport with a large-diameter front wheel, as comfortable on asphalt as on dirt roads. Handy in the swamps and the backcountry, where roads often just end.","search":"maibatsu manchez 500cc ktm","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["mount-kalaga-national-park-01","ptt-youngin-illegal-goods-store"],"imageAlts":{"mount-kalaga-national-park-01":"Two dirt bikes at Mount Kalaga National Park in GTA VI.","ptt-youngin-illegal-goods-store":"Decorated dirt bike in the PTT YOUNGIN$ shop in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=500cc%20KTM","reelNom":"500cc KTM","thumb":"/img/officiel/mount-kalaga-national-park-01-480.webp"},{"id":"maibatsu-sanchez","nom":"Sanchez","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Yamaha YZ450F 2006-2009","src":"First trailer","search":"maibatsu sanchez yamaha yz450f 2006-2009","txt":"The Sanchez shows up in official media without Rockstar giving its name. The reference we use for this bike is the Yamaha YZ450F from the 2006 to 2009 model years. The identification and the match come from the community; the listed source is the first trailer.","medias":["jason-and-lucia-09"],"imageAlts":{"jason-and-lucia-09":"Jason and Lucia on a yellow motorcycle identified as a Maibatsu Sanchez, chased by the police."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yamaha%20YZ450F","reelNom":"Yamaha YZ450F","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/officiel/jason-and-lucia-09-480.webp"},{"id":"yamaha-bws-125","nom":"BWs 125","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Yamaha BWs 125","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The fat-tired city scooter based on the Yamaha BWs 125, the one you can park anywhere and that takes curbs without flinching. The in-game name hasn’t been announced. The Extended Look slips it into traffic in a residential area.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yamaha%20BWs%20125","reelNom":"Yamaha BWs 125","search":"unknown brand bws 125 yamaha bws 125","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/yamaha-bws-125.svg"},{"id":"suzuki-gsx-r1000","nom":"GSX-R1000","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Suzuki GSX-R1000","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A Japanese sport bike copied line for line from the Suzuki GSX-R1000, with no in-game name or fictional maker so far. It’s the kind of bike you see in packs on the boulevards, redlining between two lanes of traffic. Official screenshots show it alongside Lucia.","medias":["lucia-caminos-03"],"imageAlts":{"lucia-caminos-03":"Lucia sitting on a yellow motorcycle, matched to a Suzuki GSX-R1000"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Suzuki%20GSX-R1000","reelNom":"Suzuki GSX-R1000","search":"unknown brand gsx-r1000 suzuki gsx-r1000","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/officiel/lucia-caminos-03-480.webp"},{"id":"pomazoom-mobility-scooter","nom":"Pomazoom","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Pride Maxima 3","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The three-wheeled electric scooter of sidewalks and supermarket parking lots, modeled on a Pride Maxima 3. Rockstar turned it into a drivable vehicle called the Pomazoom, front basket included. Official screenshots catch it in the middle of crossing a parking lot.","medias":["leonida-keys-02"],"imageAlts":{"leonida-keys-02":"Rider on a blue mobility scooter in the Leonida Keys, near an alligator"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pride%20Maxima%203","reelNom":"Pride Maxima 3","search":"unknown brand pomazoom pride maxima 3","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-02-480.webp"},{"id":"nagasaki-blazer-lifeguard","nom":"Blazer Lifeguard","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"moto","st":"comm","insp":null,"src":"Community match","search":"nagasaki blazer lifeguard beach quad in rescue configuration","txt":"Rescue version of the Blazer, in lifeguard colors. This type of quad really is used on the beaches of Miami Beach to patrol and respond quickly on the sand. The match with Leonida comes from players, since no official media showing it has been identified so far.","fam":"Beach quad in rescue configuration","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Quad%20de%20plage%20en%20configuration%20de%20sauvetage","reelNom":"Beach quad in rescue configuration","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-blazer-lifeguard.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-carbon-rs","nom":"Carbon RS","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Ducati 1199, EBR 1190RS","txt":"Fully faired sport bike with an under-seat exhaust. The Carbon RS is the fastest bike in the previous games, and one of the few that’s as effective in a straight line as it is unrideable in the wet.","search":"nagasaki carbon rs ducati 1199, ebr 1190rs","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ducati%201199","reelNom":"Ducati 1199","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-carbon-rs.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-bati-801","nom":"Bati 801","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Ducati 848","src":"Official artwork","txt":"Pegassi’s sport bike, drawn from the Ducati 848: sleek fairing, tank sculpted for the forearms, folded-in-half riding position. It appears in the artwork Rockstar released, which puts it in the game even before any footage shows it in motion.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ducati%20848","reelNom":"Ducati 848","search":"pegassi bati 801 ducati 848","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-bati-801.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-faggio","nom":"Faggio","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Piaggio Vespa","src":"Extended Look","search":"pegassi faggio piaggio vespa","txt":"The scooter is the exact opposite of the rest of the Pegassi catalog, which is what makes the joke funny. The Vespa whose silhouette it borrows is a design icon in its own right, created in 1946 to put Italy back on wheels with a minimum of steel. The Extended Look shows it squeezed between two lanes of stopped traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Piaggio%20Vespa","reelNom":"Piaggio Vespa","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-faggio.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-faggio-sport","nom":"Faggio Sport","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Piaggio Zip, Peugeot V-Clic and Kymco Agility 50","src":"Extended Look","search":"pegassi faggio sport piaggio zip, peugeot v-clic and kymco agility 50","txt":"The modern version of the Pegassi scooter, with the angular styling of today’s small 50 cc scooters: plastic bodywork, cast wheels, headlight built into the front apron. A far cry from the retro charm of the classic Faggio, it’s the ride of delivery workers and high schoolers, the one you see all over the streets of Vice City in the Extended Look. The word Sport promises nothing: it won’t outpace the line of cars it’s weaving past.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Piaggio%20Zip","reelNom":"Piaggio Zip","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-faggio-sport.svg"},{"id":"principe-alvino-v1","nom":"Alvino V1","marque":"Principe","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Ducati Panigale V2 Sport Bike","src":"Official screenshots","search":"principe alvino v1 ducati panigale v2 sport bike","txt":"Principe is the series’ Italian motorcycle brand, in the Ducati mold. The Alvino V1 is a trellis-frame sport bike, a design that gives these machines their visual signature as much as their stiffness. Official screenshots show it on its stand, fairing intact.","medias":["jason-duval-01"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ducati%20Panigale%20V2%20Sport%20Bike","reelNom":"Ducati Panigale V2 Sport Bike","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/jason-duval-01-480.webp"},{"id":"principe-lectro","nom":"Lectro","marque":"Principe","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Ducati Streetfighter S, MV Agusta Brutale S","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A punchy Principe naked bike, somewhere between the Ducati Streetfighter S and the MV Agusta Brutale S: wide handlebars, exposed trellis frame, nothing to hide behind from the wind. The Extended Look sends it down a coastal road, front wheel going light.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ducati%20Streetfighter%20S","reelNom":"Ducati Streetfighter S","search":"principe lectro ducati streetfighter s, mv agusta brutale s","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/principe-lectro.svg"},{"id":"shitzu-pcj-600","nom":"PCJ-600","marque":"Shitzu","cat":"moto","st":"comm","insp":"Yamaha YZF-R6","src":"Community match","search":"shitzu pcj-600 yamaha yzf-r6","txt":"The PCJ-600 is the series’ entry-level sport bike, based on the Yamaha YZF-R6. The six-hundred-cc class was long the gateway to sport bikes: powerful enough to be demanding, light enough to stay nimble. No official confirmation.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yamaha%20YZF-R6","reelNom":"Yamaha YZF-R6","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/shitzu-pcj-600.svg"},{"id":"western-nightblade","nom":"Nightblade","marque":"Western","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Harley-Davidson Night Rod Special","txt":"Big-displacement cruiser, with a bulging tank and a low seat. Western is the Harley brand of the GTA universe.","search":"western nightblade harley-davidson night rod special","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["electric-fang-tattoo-01"],"imageAlts":{"electric-fang-tattoo-01":"Two motorcycles parked outside Electric Fang Tattoo in GTA VI; cruiser with a wide rear tire on the right."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Harley-Davidson%20Night%20Rod%20Special","reelNom":"Harley-Davidson Night Rod Special","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/electric-fang-tattoo-01-480.webp"},{"id":"western-sovereign","nom":"Sovereign","marque":"Western","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Harley Davidson Road King","txt":"Chrome-laden cruiser with valanced fenders and a detachable windshield. The American touring bike in its most classic form.","search":"western sovereign harley davidson road king","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["ambrosia-01"],"imageAlts":{"ambrosia-01":"Group of bikers riding through Ambrosia in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Harley%20Davidson%20Road%20King","reelNom":"Harley Davidson Road King","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/ambrosia-01-480.webp"},{"id":"western-zombie-chopper","nom":"Zombie Chopper","marque":"Western","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Harley Davidson Fat Bob Custom, Iron 883","src":"Second trailer","search":"western zombie chopper harley davidson fat bob custom, iron 883","txt":"The Zombie Chopper is a long-fork American custom, in the tradition of the Harley-Davidson Fat Bob Custom and Iron 883. The chopper was born from the practice of chopping everything nonessential off a production bike, hence the name. The Zombie Chopper is listed from the second trailer, under a community identification.","medias":["electric-fang-tattoo-01"],"imageAlts":{"electric-fang-tattoo-01":"Two motorcycles parked outside Electric Fang Tattoo in GTA VI; chopper on the left."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Harley%20Davidson%20Fat%20Bob%20Custom","reelNom":"Harley Davidson Fat Bob Custom","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/electric-fang-tattoo-01-480.webp"},{"id":"buckingham-maverick","nom":"Maverick","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Bell 206L Longranger","src":"Official screenshots","search":"buckingham maverick bell 206l longranger","txt":"The Maverick shows up on screen without Rockstar publishing its name. It borrows the layout of the Bell 206 LongRanger, a stretched version of one of the most-produced civilian helicopters in the world: seven seats, a single turboshaft engine, and a reliability that made it the go-to aircraft for news channels and police departments.","medias":["mount-kalaga-national-park-02"],"imageAlts":{"mount-kalaga-national-park-02":"Red and white Maverick helicopter flying in front of the hills, with a passenger at the open door."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Bell%20206L%20Longranger","reelNom":"Bell 206L Longranger","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/mount-kalaga-national-park-02-480.webp"},{"id":"buckingham-police-maverick","nom":"Police Maverick","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Eurocopter AS350B","txt":"The police helicopter, with a searchlight and camera. It shows up at high wanted levels and adds pressure from above that you can’t answer while staying on the ground.","search":"buckingham police maverick eurocopter as350b","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Eurocopter%20AS350B","reelNom":"Eurocopter AS350B","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-police-maverick.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-supervolito","nom":"SuperVolito","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Eurocopter EC145","src":"First trailer","search":"buckingham supervolito eurocopter ec145","txt":"A twin-engine executive helicopter, the SuperVolito is based on the Eurocopter EC145. This class of aircraft is used as much for flying executives as for servicing offshore oil platforms, a common job in the Gulf of Mexico. The first trailer has it flying over the bay on approach.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Eurocopter%20EC145","reelNom":"Eurocopter EC145","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-supervolito.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-swift","nom":"Swift","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"AgustaWestland AW109, Bell 222","src":"Official screenshots","search":"buckingham swift agustawestland aw109, bell 222","txt":"The Swift is a private transport helicopter, in the line of the AgustaWestland AW109: sleek profile, retractable landing gear, well-finished cabin. It’s the aircraft for anyone who wants to skip the traffic jams between the business district and the marina. Official screenshots show it sitting on a rooftop helipad.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=AgustaWestland%20AW109","reelNom":"AgustaWestland AW109","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-swift.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-valkyrie","nom":"Valkyrie","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Bell UH-1Y Venom, Bell 412","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Buckingham’s transport helicopter, a direct descendant of the Bell UH-1 and its Venom and 412 offshoots, with a Fenestron-style shrouded tail rotor. Sliding side doors and a cabin open at the sides. The Extended Look follows it in low-altitude flight.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Bell%20UH-1Y%20Venom","reelNom":"Bell UH-1Y Venom","search":"buckingham valkyrie bell uh-1y venom, bell 412","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-valkyrie.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-buzzard","nom":"Buzzard","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"AH-6 Little Bird","src":"Second trailer","search":"nagasaki buzzard ah-6 little bird","txt":"The Buzzard is back in Rockstar’s official media. It’s a light two-seat helicopter based on the AH-6 Little Bird, a compact aircraft used by US special forces precisely for its ability to land in tight spaces, including on building rooftops.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=AH-6%20Little%20Bird","reelNom":"AH-6 Little Bird","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-buzzard.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-police-buzzard","nom":"Police Buzzard","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"MH-6 Little Bird","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Police version of the Buzzard, with a livery close to that of Miami Police Department aircraft. The MH-6 Little Bird it’s modeled on is a light helicopter of military origin, chosen by city police forces for its small footprint and modest operating costs.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=MH-6%20Little%20Bird","reelNom":"MH-6 Little Bird","search":"nagasaki police buzzard mh-6 little bird","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-police-buzzard.svg"},{"id":"western-sea-sparrow","nom":"Sea Sparrow","marque":"Western","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Sikorsky S-300, formerly Hughes 300","src":"First trailer","search":"western sea sparrow sikorsky s-300, formerly hughes 300","txt":"The Sea Sparrow is a light helicopter mounted on floats. The inspiration we list for it is the Sikorsky S-300, formerly the Hughes 300. The database links it to the first trailer, with no name announced; the floats set it apart from the land version.","medias":["cover-art-sea-sparrow"],"imageAlts":{"cover-art-sea-sparrow":"Blue helicopter on floats in an illustration from the official GTA VI cover art"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sikorsky%20S-300","reelNom":"Sikorsky S-300","thumb":"/img/officiel/cover-art-sea-sparrow-480.webp"},{"id":"buckingham-luxor","nom":"Luxor","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Learjet 45","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Buckingham’s high-end business jet, built on a Learjet 45 like the Shamal but with a far more refined interior. It’s the plane for low-key arrivals on a private airstrip. The Extended Look shows it on the ground, airstair deployed.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Learjet%2045","reelNom":"Learjet 45","search":"buckingham luxor learjet 45","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-luxor.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-nimbus","nom":"Nimbus","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Cessna Citation X","src":"First trailer","txt":"A twin-jet business aircraft modeled on the Cessna Citation X, for a long time the fastest civilian plane on the market. Slim fuselage, sharply swept wings, engines mounted at the tail. The first trailer shows it crossing the Leonida sky at altitude.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cessna%20Citation%20X","reelNom":"Cessna Citation X","search":"buckingham nimbus cessna citation x","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-nimbus.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-shamal","nom":"Shamal","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Learjet 45","src":"Official screenshots","search":"buckingham shamal learjet 45","txt":"Rockstar lets it be seen in its images but keeps its name to itself. It’s a business jet based on the Learjet 45: narrow fuselage, engines at the tail end, T-tail. The Learjet defined the business aviation category in the 1960s, openly designed as a fighter jet for civilians.","medias":["vice-city-01"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Learjet%2045","reelNom":"Learjet 45","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/vice-city-01-480.webp"},{"id":"jobuilt-mammatus","nom":"Mammatus","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Cessna 172 Skyhawk","src":"Official screenshots","search":"jobuilt mammatus cessna 172 skyhawk","txt":"The aircraft can be spotted in Rockstar’s images, but the captions say nothing about it. A small high-wing single-engine plane in the Cessna mold, it’s the type of aircraft that fills Florida’s airfields: pilot training, discovery flights, private flights. Our map lists several of these airfields.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cessna%20172%20Skyhawk","reelNom":"Cessna 172 Skyhawk","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/jobuilt-mammatus.svg"},{"id":"mammoth-dodo","nom":"Dodo","marque":"Mammoth","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"De Havilland Canada DHC-2 Beaver","src":"First trailer","search":"mammoth dodo de havilland canada dhc-2 beaver","txt":"Rockstar shows it without ever calling it by name. It’s a high-wing floatplane based on the De Havilland Beaver, a Canadian plane designed for short takeoffs and water landings. Between the Keys, the swamps and Leonida’s countless lakes and waterways, the use case is obvious.","medias":["leonida-keys-01"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=De%20Havilland%20Canada%20DHC-2%20Beaver","reelNom":"De Havilland Canada DHC-2 Beaver","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-01-480.webp"},{"id":"mammoth-streamer216","nom":"Streamer216","marque":"Mammoth","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"De Havilland Canada DHC-6 Twin Otter","src":"Second trailer","txt":"The high-wing twin of island-hopping routes, taken from De Havilland Canada’s DHC-6 Twin Otter. It takes off short, lands on rough strips and carries around fifteen passengers. The second trailer catches it on final approach.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=De%20Havilland%20Canada%20DHC-6%20Twin%20Otter","reelNom":"De Havilland Canada DHC-6 Twin Otter","search":"mammoth streamer216 de havilland canada dhc-6 twin otter","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/mammoth-streamer216.svg"},{"id":"jet","nom":"Jet","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Boeing 747-400, 747-8I","txt":"Commercial airliner. Its presence at Vice City International Airport is mainly set dressing, but the series has always ended up making them flyable.","search":"unknown brand jet boeing 747-400, 747-8i","src":"Second trailer","medias":["trailer-2-jet-037"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-jet-037":"Four-engine airliner above the signs to VCI Airport, second GTA VI trailer around 00:37."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Boeing%20747-400","reelNom":"Boeing 747-400","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-jet-037-480.webp"},{"id":"western-company-duster","nom":"Duster","marque":"Western Company","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Stearman Model 75","src":"Official screenshots","search":"western company duster stearman model 75","txt":"The biplane crosses the official images, unnamed. It’s a crop-dusting biplane, in the line of the Stearman Model 75: truss frame, open cockpit, fixed landing gear. These aircraft, often converted former military trainers, still fly over farms across the American South.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Stearman%20Model%2075","reelNom":"Stearman Model 75","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/western-company-duster.svg"},{"id":"xero-blimp","nom":"Blimp","marque":"Xero","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Goodyear Aerospace GZ-20","src":"First trailer","search":"xero blimp goodyear aerospace gz-20","txt":"The advertising blimp is part of the American landscape, especially over stadiums and big events. Xero is the series’ oil brand, and this kind of advertising tie-in is true to life. The blimp is definitely in the images; its name isn’t.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Goodyear%20Aerospace%20GZ-20","reelNom":"Goodyear Aerospace GZ-20","thumb":"/img/schemas/xero-blimp.svg"},{"id":"airboat-09","nom":"Airboat 09","marque":"Airgator","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Diamondback Hunting & Fishing airboat","src":"Official screenshots","search":"airgator airboat 09 diamondback hunting & fishing airboat","txt":"The propeller-driven airboat is inseparable from the Everglades: flat hull, aircraft engine at the stern, raised tiers of seats for sightseeing tours. It skims over just a few inches of water and cuts through the marsh grass. The Airgator name makes no secret of its nod to the alligators these boats take visitors to see.","medias":["grassrivers-01"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Hydroglisseur%20Diamondback%20Hunting%20%26%20Fishing","reelNom":"Diamondback Hunting & Fishing airboat","thumb":"/img/officiel/grassrivers-01-480.webp"},{"id":"btn-delmar","nom":"Delmar","marque":"BTN","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"BTN Delmar","src":"First trailer","search":"btn delmar btn delmar","txt":"The Delmar is a coastal cabin fishing boat, the kind that heads out for the day from Florida marinas. It’s built for work: open deck, rod holders, high freeboard. The first trailer shows it tied up along a dock.","fam":"Coastal cabin fishing boat","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BTN%20Delmar","reelNom":"BTN Delmar","thumb":"/img/schemas/btn-delmar.svg"},{"id":"crest-kayak","nom":"Kayak","marque":"Crest","cat":"bateau","st":"officiel","insp":"Crescent kayak, several variants","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"crest kayak crescent kayak, several variants","txt":"The kayak is named by Rockstar, and our official screenshot shows it in use at sunset, with the Crest brand readable on the hull. It’s a sit-on-top sea kayak, an open boat especially well suited to the warm, shallow waters of the Keys. Another screenshot shows it sitting outside Jason’s safehouse.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["crest-kayak","jason-s-safehouse-vehicles","mount-kalaga-national-park-06"],"perso":"jason","imageAlts":{"mount-kalaga-national-park-06":"Orange Crest kayak on a river under a railroad bridge in Mount Kalaga National Park."},"vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Kayak%20Crescent","reelNom":"Crescent kayak","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/crest-kayak-480.webp"},{"id":"dinka-jetmax","nom":"Jetmax","marque":"Dinka","cat":"bateau","st":"comm","insp":null,"src":"Community match","search":"dinka jetmax v-hull sport speedboat","txt":"The Jetmax is a sport speedboat built for speed on calm water: streamlined hull, low helm, oversized engines. Vice City’s sheltered bays are the ideal playground. Model not confirmed by Rockstar.","fam":"V-hull sport speedboat","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Hors-bord%20de%20sport%20%C3%A0%20coque%20en%20V","reelNom":"V-hull sport speedboat","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-jetmax.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-marquis","nom":"Marquis","marque":"Dinka","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Adjutor Yachts","src":"Second trailer","search":"dinka marquis adjutor yachts","txt":"The Marquis is listed as a cruising sailboat, with Adjutor Yachts as its inspiration. The brand listed in our database is Dinka. Its appearance is tied to the second trailer, with no official caption giving its name.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Adjutor%20Yachts","reelNom":"Adjutor Yachts","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-marquis.svg"},{"id":"lure-predator-l35p","nom":"Predator L35P","marque":"Lure","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Contender 25T","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Center console fishing boat, with a T-top and outriggers. The Lure Predator branding is visible in official screenshots, which makes it one of the few named boats in the game. A version in police livery also exists.","search":"lure predator l35p contender 25t","medias":["leonida-keys-05"],"imageAlts":{"leonida-keys-05":"Boats gathered in the Leonida Keys, with a powerboat marked Lure Predator in the foreground."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Contender%2025T","reelNom":"Contender 25T","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-05-480.webp"},{"id":"lure-predator-l35p-police","nom":"Police Predator L35P","marque":"Lure","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Contender 25T","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Law enforcement livery version of the Predator L35P: emergency lights, reflective stripes, searchlight. Marine police are an everyday reality in a state made up of so many canals and coastlines, and they get involved in chases on the water.","search":"lure predator l35p police contender 25t","medias":["shitzu-squalo-04"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Contender%2025T","reelNom":"Contender 25T","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/shitzu-squalo-04-480.webp"},{"id":"lure-predator-s23","nom":"Predator S23","marque":"Lure","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Contender 25 Bay","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Small shallow-water fishing boat, seven meters long, with a shallow-draft hull designed for bays and mangroves. The most common format among Florida anglers, a far cry from offshore boats.","search":"lure predator s23 contender 25 bay","medias":["leonida-keys-05"],"imageAlts":{"leonida-keys-05":"Boats gathered in the Leonida Keys, with a powerboat marked Lure Predator in the foreground."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Contender%2025%20Bay","reelNom":"Contender 25 Bay","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-05-480.webp"},{"id":"azimut-85","nom":"Azimut 85","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Azimut 85","src":"Second trailer","txt":"Twenty-six-meter motor yacht, in the large cruising yacht class. The Azimut 85 comes from an Italian shipyard whose models fill the marinas of Miami Beach. Its in-game name hasn’t been announced by Rockstar.","search":"unknown brand azimut 85 azimut 85","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Azimut%2085","reelNom":"Azimut 85","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/azimut-85.svg"},{"id":"azimut-atlantis-45","nom":"Azimut Atlantis 45","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Azimut Atlantis 45","src":"Second trailer","txt":"Cabin cruiser, fourteen meters long, the in-between format between the day speedboat and the liveaboard yacht. It’s the boat of a well-off owner who goes out on weekends rather than a shipowner’s. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand azimut atlantis 45 azimut atlantis 45","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Azimut%20Atlantis%2045","reelNom":"Azimut Atlantis 45","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/azimut-atlantis-45.svg"},{"id":"fishing-boat","nom":"Fishing boat","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Steiger Craft 31 Miami","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Coastal fishing boat with an enclosed cabin, nine meters long. The Steiger Craft whose lines it borrows literally has Miami in its model name. It’s a working fisherman’s tool rather than a weekend boater’s toy.","search":"unknown brand fishing boat steiger craft 31 miami","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Steiger%20Craft%2031%20Miami","reelNom":"Steiger Craft 31 Miami","thumb":"/img/schemas/fishing-boat.svg"},{"id":"water-taxi","nom":"Water taxi","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Miami water taxi","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Passenger water shuttle, spotted in the Extended Look. Miami runs a real water taxi network between downtown, the beach and the islands. Its presence in Leonida suggests an extra way to get around, separate from the bus and the elevated metro.","search":"unknown brand water taxi miami water taxi","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Bateau-taxi%20de%20Miami","reelNom":"Miami water taxi","thumb":"/img/schemas/water-taxi.svg"},{"id":"bavaria-sr33","nom":"Bavaria SR33","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Bavaria SR33","src":"First trailer","txt":"German sport boat with a deep hull, designed for rough seas rather than lagoons. Bavaria is best known for its sailboats, and this powerboat line is its shot at the sport boat market. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand bavaria sr33 bavaria sr33","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Bavaria%20SR33","reelNom":"Bavaria SR33","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/bavaria-sr33.svg"},{"id":"clarion","nom":"Clarion","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Cigarette 38 Top Gun","src":"First trailer","txt":"Racing speedboat with a very slender hull, in the line of the Cigarette 38 Top Gun. These boats have a heavy history in Miami: built for offshore racing, they were used en masse by 1980s smugglers because they could outrun Customs boats. It doesn’t get more Vice City than that.","search":"unknown brand clarion cigarette 38 top gun","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cigarette%2038%20Top%20Gun","reelNom":"Cigarette 38 Top Gun","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/clarion.svg"},{"id":"contender-39st","nom":"Contender 39ST","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Contender 39ST","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Big-game fishing boat with a center console, twelve meters long, four outboard motors at the stern. Contender is a South Florida boatbuilder whose boats are made to run far and fast. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand contender 39st contender 39st","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Contender%2039ST","reelNom":"Contender 39ST","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/contender-39st.svg"},{"id":"crownline-275-ss","nom":"Crownline 275 SS","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Crownline 275 SS","src":"First trailer","txt":"Recreational bowrider, eight meters long, with an open cockpit and bow seating. It’s the quintessential American family boat: waterskiing, swimming, drinks at anchor. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand crownline 275 ss crownline 275 ss","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Crownline%20275%20SS","reelNom":"Crownline 275 SS","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/crownline-275-ss.svg"},{"id":"crusader-boats-gfy","nom":"Crusader Boats GFY","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Crusader Boats GFY","src":"First trailer","txt":"Dive boat with an open deck, ten meters long, with a swim platform and tank racks. Florida’s reefs support a whole economy of dive trips, and this is exactly the type of boat you charter for the day. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand crusader boats gfy crusader boats gfy","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Crusader%20Boats%20GFY","reelNom":"Crusader Boats GFY","thumb":"/img/schemas/crusader-boats-gfy.svg"},{"id":"shipyard-de-hoop-brion","nom":"De Hoop Brion","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Shipyard De Hoop Brion","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Dutch utility vessel, with a work hull and a deck crane. It’s neither a pleasure boat nor a fishing boat, but one of those workhorse vessels that crowd commercial ports. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand de hoop brion shipyard de hoop brion","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Shipyard%20De%20Hoop%20Brion","reelNom":"Shipyard De Hoop Brion","thumb":"/img/schemas/shipyard-de-hoop-brion.svg"},{"id":"ferry","nom":"Ferry","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Fisher Island ferry","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Passenger and vehicle ferry, modeled on the ones serving Fisher Island, the private island off Miami Beach that can only be reached by boat. Its presence suggests that part of the Leonida map isn’t connected by road.","search":"unknown brand ferry fisher island ferry","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferry%20de%20Fisher%20Island","reelNom":"Fisher Island ferry","thumb":"/img/schemas/ferry.svg"},{"id":"frauscher-1017-gt","nom":"Frauscher 1017 GT","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Frauscher 1017 GT","src":"First trailer","txt":"Austrian day boat with sharply styled lines, ten meters long. Frauscher shapes its hulls like sports car bodies, which has earned it a reputation all its own in boating. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand frauscher 1017 gt frauscher 1017 gt","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Frauscher%201017%20GT","reelNom":"Frauscher 1017 GT","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/frauscher-1017-gt.svg"},{"id":"highfield-sport-900","nom":"Highfield Sport 900","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Highfield Sport 900","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Nine-meter RIB, with an aluminum hull and inflatable tubes. These boats serve as tenders for big yachts and as fast shuttles between the anchorage and the shore. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand highfield sport 900 highfield sport 900","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Highfield%20Sport%20900","reelNom":"Highfield Sport 900","thumb":"/img/schemas/highfield-sport-900.svg"},{"id":"horizon-power-catamarans-pc60","nom":"Horizon PC60","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Horizon Power Catamarans PC60","src":"First trailer","txt":"Eighteen-meter power catamaran. The twin hulls offer stability and living space that a monohull of the same length can’t match, at the cost of a beam that makes docking harder. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand horizon pc60 horizon power catamarans pc60","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Horizon%20Power%20Catamarans%20PC60","reelNom":"Horizon Power Catamarans PC60","thumb":"/img/schemas/horizon-power-catamarans-pc60.svg"},{"id":"lurssen-73m-coral-ocean","nom":"Lürssen 73m","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Lürssen Coral Ocean","src":"First trailer","txt":"Seventy-three-meter superyacht, the top of the game’s boating pecking order. Lürssen is the German shipyard that builds the biggest private yachts in the world. A ship like that at anchor isn’t a vehicle, it’s scenery, and a status symbol. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand lurssen 73m lurssen coral ocean","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=L%C3%BCrssen%20Coral%20Ocean","reelNom":"Lürssen Coral Ocean","thumb":"/img/schemas/lurssen-73m-coral-ocean.svg"},{"id":"cruise-ship","nom":"Cruise ship","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Royal Caribbean Voyager","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Cruise ship, one of the biggest moving objects in the game. The Port of Miami is the world’s top cruise port, and these ships are as much a part of the city’s skyline as its hotels. It probably can’t be piloted, but its presence at the port shapes the scenery.","search":"unknown brand cruise ship royal caribbean voyager","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Royal%20Caribbean%20Voyager","reelNom":"Royal Caribbean Voyager","thumb":"/img/schemas/cruise-ship.svg"},{"id":"rb-s","nom":"RB-S","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Coast Guard RB-S patrol boat","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Coast Guard response boat, with a rigid hull and tubes, and outboard motors. The Response Boat Small is the standard patrol boat of the US Coast Guard. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand rb-s coast guard rb-s patrol boat","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Vedette%20garde-c%C3%B4tes%20RB-S","reelNom":"Coast Guard RB-S patrol boat","thumb":"/img/schemas/rb-s.svg"},{"id":"rb-s-ii","nom":"RB-S II","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Coast Guard RB-S II patrol boat","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Second generation of the Coast Guard patrol boat, longer and with more power. It patrols the coasts and the inlets, while the marine police stick to inland waters. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand rb-s ii coast guard rb-s ii patrol boat","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Vedette%20garde-c%C3%B4tes%20RB-S%20II","reelNom":"Coast Guard RB-S II patrol boat","thumb":"/img/schemas/rb-s-ii.svg"},{"id":"riva-86-domino","nom":"Riva 86 Domino","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Riva 86 Domino","src":"First trailer","txt":"Twenty-six-meter Italian yacht. Riva is to boats what Ferrari is to cars: a name that works as shorthand for wealth and taste. The Domino is its modern take, all glass and taut lines. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand riva 86 domino riva 86 domino","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Riva%2086%20Domino","reelNom":"Riva 86 Domino","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/riva-86-domino.svg"},{"id":"sea-ray-350-sundancer","nom":"Sea Ray 350 Sundancer","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Sea Ray 350 Sundancer","src":"First trailer","txt":"Eleven-meter cabin cruiser, with a berth and a galley below deck. Sea Ray is the biggest American builder of pleasure boats, and the Sundancer is its best-selling line. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand sea ray 350 sundancer sea ray 350 sundancer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sea%20Ray%20350%20Sundancer","reelNom":"Sea Ray 350 Sundancer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/sea-ray-350-sundancer.svg"},{"id":"sea-doo-rxt-x-300","nom":"Sea-Doo RXT-X 300","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Sea-Doo RXT-X 300","src":"First trailer","txt":"High-powered three-seat jet ski, separate from the Seashark that’s already in this database. The RXT-X is the sporty version of the lineup, the one that tops a hundred kilometers per hour. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand sea-doo rxt-x 300 sea-doo rxt-x 300","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sea-Doo%20RXT-X%20300","reelNom":"Sea-Doo RXT-X 300","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/sea-doo-rxt-x-300.svg"},{"id":"skater-388","nom":"Skater 388","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Skater 388","src":"First trailer","txt":"Offshore racing catamaran, with a central tunnel in the hull that lifts the boat at high speed. These machines top two hundred kilometers per hour and have no use outside racing and showing off. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand skater 388 skater 388","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Skater%20388","reelNom":"Skater 388","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/skater-388.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-dinghy","nom":"Dinghy","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Rigid-hulled inflatable boat","src":"Second trailer","search":"nagasaki dinghy rigid-hulled inflatable boat","txt":"The Dinghy is a RIB: a rigid hull topped with inflatable tubes. It’s the utility boat par excellence, used to reach a boat at anchor, for diving or for quick-response jobs. The second trailer has it speeding between two mangrove banks.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rigid-hulled%20inflatable%20boat","reelNom":"Rigid-hulled inflatable boat","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-dinghy.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-speeder","nom":"Speeder","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Coeur 290 Nighthawk, Cherubini Classic 20","src":"First trailer","search":"pegassi speeder coeur 290 nighthawk, cherubini classic 20","txt":"The Speeder is a high-performance speedboat, in the line of Cigarette Racing boats. These deep-V boats have a special history in Miami: built for offshore racing in the 1970s, they were quickly adopted for other activities along the Florida coast. The first trailer shows it at full throttle, bow out of the water.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Coeur%20290%20Nighthawk","reelNom":"Coeur 290 Nighthawk","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-speeder.svg"},{"id":"shitzu-longfin","nom":"Longfin","marque":"Shitzu","cat":"bateau","st":"comm","insp":"Offshore fishing boat","txt":"Big-game fishing boat with a raised cabin, tower and outriggers. The kind of boat you charter for the day all along the Florida coast, and one that also serves, in fiction as in real life, other lines of business.","search":"shitzu longfin offshore fishing boat","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Vedette%20de%20p%C3%AAche%20hauturi%C3%A8re","reelNom":"Offshore fishing boat","thumb":"/img/schemas/shitzu-longfin.svg"},{"id":"shitzu-squalo","nom":"Squalo","marque":"Shitzu","cat":"bateau","st":"officiel","insp":"Chris-Craft Stinger 390x","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"shitzu squalo chris-craft stinger 390x","txt":"The Squalo’s name appears in black and white in the Ultimate Edition description, and the official screenshots leave no doubt: the Shitzu logo and the Squalo name are readable on the hull and the windshield. You can see the palm-leaf livery, the teak deck, the fishing rods, a scuba tank and the registration number VB 0522 05. The hull is taken from the Chris-Craft Stinger 390x, a 1980s sport speedboat whose low profile and pointed nose are inseparable from Miami imagery.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["shitzu-squalo-01","shitzu-squalo-02","shitzu-squalo-03","shitzu-squalo-04"],"vuesDeclarees":["face","profil","arriere","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chris-Craft%20Stinger%20390x","reelNom":"Chris-Craft Stinger 390x","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/shitzu-squalo-01-480.webp"},{"id":"shitzu-tropic","nom":"Tropic","marque":"Shitzu","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Sea Ray 300 Sundancer","src":"First trailer","search":"shitzu tropic sea ray 300 sundancer","txt":"The Tropic is a recreational cabin cruiser, based on the Sea Ray 300 Sundancer. It’s the quintessential American family boat: roomy enough to sleep aboard, seaworthy enough to leave the bay, and sold by the thousands all along the Florida coast. The kind of boat you find tied up behind canal-front houses.","medias":["trailer-1-tropic-011"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-tropic-011":"White cabin pleasure boat seen from above near dolphins, first GTA VI trailer around 00:11."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sea%20Ray%20300%20Sundancer","reelNom":"Sea Ray 300 Sundancer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-tropic-011-480.webp"},{"id":"speedophile-seashark","nom":"Seashark","marque":"Speedophile","cat":"bateau","st":"officiel","insp":"Sea-Doo GTX","src":"Second trailer","search":"speedophile seashark sea-doo gtx","txt":"Its name is readable on the side of the hull in the second trailer, when Jason and Lucia race across the bay on it at full speed. It’s a three-seat jet ski based on the Sea-Doo GTX: jet pump propulsion, composite hull, no visible propeller. The brand name is one of the most blatant jokes in the catalog.","medias":["trailer-2-seashark-141"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-seashark-141":"Jason and Lucia on a green jet ski; the Seashark name is readable on the hull, second GTA VI trailer around 02:21."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sea-Doo%20GTX","reelNom":"Sea-Doo GTX","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-seashark-141-480.webp"},{"id":"vortex-airboat","nom":"Airboat","marque":"Vortex","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Panther airboat","src":"First trailer","txt":"The airboat is GTA VI’s real new addition on the water: never seen before in the series. Flat hull, huge caged air propeller: it skims over a few inches of water and goes where no other hull can. This type of craft is associated with Florida’s swamps. How you get around the Grassrivers still needs to be checked in the game.","search":"vortex airboat panther airboat airboat","medias":["grassrivers-03"],"imageAlts":{"grassrivers-03":"Airboat seen from above among alligators and aquatic plants in Grassrivers."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Hydroglisseur%20Panther%20Airboat","reelNom":"Panther airboat","thumb":"/img/officiel/grassrivers-03-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-bison-1800-police","nom":"Bison 1800 (Police)","marque":"Bravado","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ram 1500 DT","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Patrol variant of the Bison 1800. South Florida agencies really do use pickups this size for off-pavement calls, on wetland trails or beach access roads where a regular police car gets stuck.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ram%201500%20DT","reelNom":"Ram 1500 DT","search":"bravado bison 1800 (police) ram 1500 dt","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-bison-1800-police.svg"},{"id":"bravado-buffalo-stx-pursuit","nom":"Buffalo STX Pursuit","marque":"Bravado","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Charger Pursuit","src":"First trailer","search":"bravado buffalo stx pursuit dodge charger pursuit","txt":"Patrol version of the Buffalo STX: light bar, department livery, heavy-duty suspension and cooling. In the US, automakers really do sell certified police variants that are mechanically different from the civilian models. The first trailer sends it into a chase, lights flashing.","medias":["jason-and-lucia-09","vice-city-06"],"imageAlts":{"jason-and-lucia-09":"Jason and Lucia on a yellow motorcycle identified as a Maibatsu Sanchez, chased by the police.","vice-city-06":"Vice Beach Police Buffalo STX surrounded by officers and women passing by outside the Ocean View Hotel."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Charger%20Pursuit","reelNom":"Dodge Charger Pursuit","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/jason-and-lucia-09-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-gauntlet-interceptor","nom":"Gauntlet Interceptor","marque":"Bravado","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Challenger in police configuration","src":"First trailer","search":"bravado gauntlet interceptor dodge challenger in police configuration","txt":"Interceptor variant of the Gauntlet, built for pursuit rather than patrol. US agencies regularly field muscle cars in this role, less for their actual effectiveness than for their deterrent effect. The first trailer shows it stopped across the road, doors open.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Challenger%20en%20configuration%20de%20police","reelNom":"Dodge Challenger in police configuration","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-gauntlet-interceptor.svg"},{"id":"bravado-police-cruiser-buffalo","nom":"Police Cruiser (Buffalo)","marque":"Bravado","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Charger","txt":"The Buffalo in city patrol livery. Leonida law enforcement doesn’t use the same vehicle everywhere: the city, the highway and the backcountry each have their own setup.","search":"bravado police cruiser (buffalo) dodge charger","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Charger","reelNom":"Dodge Charger","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-police-cruiser-buffalo.svg"},{"id":"brute-ambulance","nom":"Ambulance","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Express 3500 cutaway chassis","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The Leonida ambulance follows the usual American format: a Chevrolet Express cutaway chassis topped with an add-on patient compartment, wider than the cab. In the US, these boxes are fitted by specialized upfitters, which explains the sharp break in the lines right behind the front doors.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Express%203500%20ch%C3%A2ssis-cabine","reelNom":"Chevrolet Express 3500 cutaway chassis","search":"brute ambulance chevrolet express 3500 cutaway chassis","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-ambulance.svg"},{"id":"brute-bus","nom":"Bus","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"New Flyer Xcelsior","txt":"Low-floor city bus. Some of its stops are on our map. This vehicle is listed from official media, while what the player can do with it is still to be checked in the game.","search":"brute bus new flyer xcelsior","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=New%20Flyer%20Xcelsior","reelNom":"New Flyer Xcelsior","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-bus.svg"},{"id":"brute-police-riot","nom":"Police Riot","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Lenco BEAR","src":"Second trailer","search":"brute police riot lenco bear","txt":"The armored riot van can be seen on screen, but its name remains unknown. These vehicles, often military surplus handed down to local police, have become a topic of public debate in the US. Their presence in a city like Vice City is no small detail.","medias":["trailer-2-police-riot-119"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-police-riot-119":"Black armored van facing Lucia, to the left of the car thrown by the explosion, second GTA VI trailer around 01:59."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lenco%20BEAR","reelNom":"Lenco BEAR","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-police-riot-119-480.webp"},{"id":"brute-rental-shuttle-bus","nom":"Rental Shuttle Bus","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"1996-2002 Chevrolet Express","txt":"Shuttle minibus, the one that links terminals to parking lots and hotels. A vehicle you only notice at airports, and Leonida has several of those.","search":"brute rental shuttle bus 1996-2002 chevrolet express","src":"Second trailer","medias":["leonida-keys-02"],"imageAlts":{"leonida-keys-02":"White minibus on the right in the Leonida Keys street scene in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Express","reelNom":"Chevrolet Express","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-02-480.webp"},{"id":"brute-stockade","nom":"Stockade","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"International 4700 Series","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The armored cash-in-transit truck, built on the same International 4700 chassis as the Benson but fitted with a reinforced body pierced with gun ports. It’s as much a heist target as a vehicle. The Extended Look shows it parked outside a bank branch.","medias":["extended-look-stockade"],"imageAlts":{"extended-look-stockade":"Armored truck in the middle of the street, still from An Extended Look"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%204700%20Series","reelNom":"International 4700 Series","search":"brute stockade international 4700 series","thumb":"/img/officiel/extended-look-stockade-480.webp"},{"id":"brute-tipper-6-wheels","nom":"Tipper (6 wheels)","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Kodiak, GMC TopKick","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Brute’s six-wheel dump truck, built on a Kodiak and TopKick base: two rear axles, tipping bed, sized between a work truck and a heavy truck. The Extended Look shows it driving loaded along a construction site track.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Kodiak","reelNom":"Chevrolet Kodiak","search":"brute tipper (6 wheels) chevrolet kodiak, gmc topkick","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-tipper-6-wheels.svg"},{"id":"brute-utility-truck","nom":"Utility Truck","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"International 4700 Series","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Brute’s utility truck, with its bucket lift folded on the bed and toolboxes on the sides, built on an International 4700 Series chassis. It’s the rig of the crews who repair power lines. The Extended Look shows it parked, outriggers deployed.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%204700%20Series","reelNom":"International 4700 Series","search":"brute utility truck international 4700 series","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-utility-truck.svg"},{"id":"declasse-granger-taxi","nom":"Granger Taxi","marque":"Declasse","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Suburban","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The Granger painted as a taxi, a big Suburban topped with the lit roof sign. It’s the group ride, the one that takes a whole family and their luggage when a sedan isn’t enough. The Extended Look leaves it waiting outside a hotel entrance.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Suburban","reelNom":"Chevrolet Suburban","search":"declasse granger taxi chevrolet suburban","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-granger-taxi.svg"},{"id":"declasse-sheriff-suv","nom":"Sheriff SUV","marque":"Declasse","cat":"service","st":"comm","insp":"Sheriff’s Chevrolet Tahoe","txt":"The sheriff’s office SUV, used outside city limits. The split between city police and county sheriff shapes the Leonida map as much as geography does.","search":"declasse sheriff suv sheriff chevrolet tahoe","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Tahoe%20de%20sh%C3%A9rif","reelNom":"Sheriff’s Chevrolet Tahoe","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-sheriff-suv.svg"},{"id":"dundreary-police-landstalker-xl","nom":"Police Landstalker XL","marque":"Dundreary","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Lincoln Navigator","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Large SUV in police colors, derived from the civilian Landstalker XL. A vehicle this size is rarely used for pursuits: US agencies keep it for supervisors, moving teams and bulky gear. Spotted in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Navigator","reelNom":"Lincoln Navigator","search":"dundreary police landstalker xl lincoln navigator fourth generation","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dundreary-police-landstalker-xl.svg"},{"id":"hvy-airtug","nom":"Airtug","marque":"HVY","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Clark CT30","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The small airport tug that pulls baggage carts between the terminal and the cargo hold. Its shape comes from the Clark CT30, an airport vehicle nobody ever notices but that drives all over the tarmac. The Extended Look catches it at work at the Leonida airport.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Clark%20CT30","reelNom":"Clark CT30","search":"hvy airtug clark ct30","thumb":"/img/schemas/hvy-airtug.svg"},{"id":"hvy-biff","nom":"Biff","marque":"HVY","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Kenworth T800","src":"Extended Look","txt":"HVY’s dump truck, built on a short-cab Kenworth T800 chassis. It hauls gravel and dirt from one job site to the next, and it’s heavy enough to go through an intersection without slowing down. The Extended Look places it on a construction site.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Kenworth%20T800","reelNom":"Kenworth T800","search":"hvy biff kenworth t800","thumb":"/img/schemas/hvy-biff.svg"},{"id":"hvy-forklift","nom":"Forklift","marque":"HVY","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Yale GLP060VX","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The forklift of warehouses and loading docks, modeled on a Yale GLP060VX. Slow, low to the ground, unable to get over a curb, but essential the moment a pallet needs moving. Official screenshots place it in an industrial area.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yale%20GLP060VX","reelNom":"Yale GLP060VX","search":"hvy forklift yale glp060vx","thumb":"/img/schemas/hvy-forklift.svg"},{"id":"jacksheepe-excavator","nom":"Excavator","marque":"Jacksheepe","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Liebherr R954B HD-S, Samsung SE280LC-2","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Jacksheepe’s tracked excavator, a mix of a Liebherr R954B HD-S and a Samsung SE280LC-2. Swiveling upper structure, articulated arm, and a bucket wide enough to flip a sedan without breaking a sweat. The Extended Look puts it to work on an earthmoving job.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Liebherr%20R954B%20HD-S","reelNom":"Liebherr R954B HD-S","search":"jacksheepe excavator liebherr r954b hd-s, samsung se280lc-2","thumb":"/img/schemas/jacksheepe-excavator.svg"},{"id":"mtl-flatbed","nom":"Flatbed","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"2004 Freightliner Century Class 112","src":"Extended Look","search":"jobuilt flatbed 2004 freightliner century class 112","txt":"The Flatbed is a flatbed truck, used to haul vehicles or bulky loads. Our database credits this version to JoBuilt and matches it to the Freightliner Century Class 112 from 2004. The Extended Look shows it carrying a wreck, bed tilted.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2004%20Freightliner%20Century%20Class%20112","reelNom":"2004 Freightliner Century Class 112","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/mtl-flatbed.svg"},{"id":"jobuilt-hauler","nom":"Hauler","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Freightliner and Kenworth semi trucks","src":"Official screenshots","search":"jobuilt hauler freightliner and kenworth semi trucks","txt":"The Hauler is a semi tractor, the front half of a tractor-trailer. JoBuilt is the series’ heavy equipment brand. Vice City’s port and the highways running up to northern Leonida are the natural turf for this type of vehicle. Official screenshots show it hitched up, ready to roll.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Tracteurs%20routiers%20Freightliner","reelNom":"Freightliner semi trucks","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/jobuilt-hauler.svg"},{"id":"jobuilt-phantom","nom":"Phantom","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Peterbilt 359 EXHD","src":"First trailer","search":"jobuilt phantom peterbilt 359 exhd","txt":"The Phantom is a long-cab semi tractor, the kind that crosses the US coast to coast with a sleeper behind the seats. The first trailer shows it passing on a highway.","medias":["trailer-1-phantom-003"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-phantom-003":"Semi truck pulling a Patriot trailer in the middle of the highway, first GTA VI trailer around 00:03."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Peterbilt%20359%20EXHD","reelNom":"Peterbilt 359 EXHD","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-phantom-003-480.webp"},{"id":"jobuilt-phantom-custom","nom":"Phantom Custom","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"1984 GMC General with a faired sleeper cab","src":"Official screenshots","search":"jobuilt phantom custom gmc general 1984 with a faired sleeper cab","txt":"Customized version of the Phantom: chrome, extra lights, detailed paint job. Decked-out truck culture is a living tradition in the US, where the rig often belongs to the driver. Official screenshots show it stopped at a rest area.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=GMC%20General%201984%20%C3%A0%20cabine%20couchette%20car%C3%A9n%C3%A9e","reelNom":"1984 GMC General with a faired sleeper cab","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/jobuilt-phantom-custom.svg"},{"id":"jobuilt-rubble","nom":"Rubble","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Peterbilt 359 EXHD","txt":"Four-axle dump truck. Construction sites are part of Vice City’s urban landscape, with machines that actually drive around instead of sitting still.","search":"jobuilt rubble peterbilt 359 exhd","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Peterbilt%20359%20EXHD","reelNom":"Peterbilt 359 EXHD","thumb":"/img/schemas/jobuilt-rubble.svg"},{"id":"maibatsu-mule","nom":"Mule","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Seventh-generation Mitsubishi Fuso Canter","txt":"Box truck built on a Japanese cab. The Mule is the series’ standard delivery and moving truck.","search":"maibatsu mule mitsubishi fuso canter seventh generation","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mitsubishi%20Fuso%20Canter","reelNom":"Mitsubishi Fuso Canter","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/maibatsu-mule.svg"},{"id":"airport-bus","nom":"Airport Bus","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The shuttle that makes the rounds of the terminals, with wide doors and a long center aisle for standing passengers, suitcases at their feet. The maker is still unknown and no real-world model has been identified so far. The Extended Look shows it serving the Vice City airport.","fam":"Airport shuttle","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Navette%20d%E2%80%99a%C3%A9roport","reelNom":"Airport shuttle","search":"unknown brand airport bus airport shuttle","thumb":"/img/schemas/airport-bus.svg"},{"id":"amloco-ge-genesis","nom":"Amloco (GE Genesis)","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"GE Genesis locomotive","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Amloco, Leonida’s rail company, pulls its passenger trains with a locomotive modeled on the GE Genesis: rounded nose, monocoque body, light-colored livery. It’s the engine for intercity service, not freight. Official screenshots frame it at the platform.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Locomotive%20GE%20Genesis","reelNom":"GE Genesis locomotive","search":"unknown brand amloco (ge genesis) ge genesis locomotive","thumb":"/img/schemas/amloco-ge-genesis.svg"},{"id":"dashound","nom":"Dashound","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"MCI Renaissance E coach, Greyhound livery","src":"First trailer","search":"unknown brand dashound mci renaissance e coach, greyhound livery","txt":"The Dashound intercity coach is a series staple, a take on a very real American company whose emblem is the greyhound. That network serves thousands of towns that planes and trains have left behind. The first trailer shows it on the highway, full livery visible.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Autocar%20MCI%20Renaissance%20E","reelNom":"MCI Renaissance E coach","thumb":"/img/schemas/dashound.svg"},{"id":"isuzu-elf-250","nom":"Elf 250","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Isuzu Elf 250","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Isuzu’s small cab-over truck, a fixture of city deliveries all over the world. Cab sitting over the engine, box in the back, tiny turning radius. The in-game name hasn’t been announced yet. It appears in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Isuzu%20Elf%20250","reelNom":"Isuzu Elf 250","search":"unknown brand elf 250 isuzu elf 250","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/isuzu-elf-250.svg"},{"id":"vapid-caracara-lifeguard","nom":"Explorer Sport Trac (Lifeguard)","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Explorer Sport Trac","txt":"Beach patrol pickup in lifeguard livery, with gear strapped down in the back. The Sport Trac was an Explorer where Ford had swapped the cargo area for a short bed, built from 2000 to 2010. Miami Beach lifeguard stations ran them for years. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand explorer sport trac (lifeguard) ford explorer sport trac","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer%20Sport%20Trac","reelNom":"Ford Explorer Sport Trac","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-caracara-lifeguard.svg"},{"id":"ford-f-series-tow-truck","nom":"F-Series tow truck","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford F-Series, tow truck configuration","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A tow truck built on a Ford F-Series base, with an exposed hydraulic boom and winch at the back. Rockstar hasn’t given it an in-game name or a fictional maker yet. The Extended Look shows it on a call, a wrecked vehicle at the end of its cable.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-Series","reelNom":"Ford F-Series","search":"unknown brand f-series tow truck ford f-series, tow truck configuration","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-f-series-tow-truck.svg"},{"id":"ford-f-series-flatbed","nom":"F-Series flatbed","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Ford F-Series","src":"First trailer","txt":"Sixth-generation Ford F-Series converted into a flatbed: the original bed replaced with a bare deck for hauling bulky gear. A common conversion in farming and construction. In-game name not disclosed.","search":"unknown brand f-series flatbed ford f-series sixth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-Series","reelNom":"Ford F-Series","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-f-series-flatbed.svg"},{"id":"freight-train","nom":"Freight Train","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Electro Motive Division, GE AC4400CW","txt":"Freight train. The rail network runs across Leonida between industrial zones, ports and city centers, with grade crossings that actually block the road.","search":"unknown brand freight train electro motive division, ge ac4400cw","src":"Official screenshots","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Electro%20Motive%20Division","reelNom":"Electro Motive Division","thumb":"/img/schemas/freight-train.svg"},{"id":"chevrolet-kodiak-gmc-topkick","nom":"Kodiak / Topkick","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Kodiak, GMC Topkick","src":"Extended Look","txt":"General Motors’ medium-duty truck, sold under both the Chevrolet Kodiak and GMC Topkick badges, with a short hood and chrome grille. It hasn’t been given an in-game name or an in-house maker. The Extended Look shows it in construction configuration.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Kodiak","reelNom":"Chevrolet Kodiak","search":"unknown brand kodiak / topkick chevrolet kodiak, gmc topkick","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chevrolet-kodiak-gmc-topkick.svg"},{"id":"international-s-series-semi-truck","nom":"S-Series","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"International S-Series, semi tractor","src":"Second trailer","txt":"An International S-Series semi tractor, recognizable by its square grille and its tall cab sitting over the engine. It hasn’t been given an in-game name or a fictional maker. The second trailer sends it down the highway, trailer hitched.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%20S-Series","reelNom":"International S-Series","search":"unknown brand s-series international s-series, semi tractor","thumb":"/img/schemas/international-s-series-semi-truck.svg"},{"id":"chevrolet-silverado-6500-hd","nom":"Silverado 6500 HD","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Silverado 6500 HD","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Medium-duty truck, well beyond a personal pickup: a chassis cab meant for work bodies, such as a tow truck, dump bed or flatbed. Spotted in the Extended Look. Its in-game name hasn’t been announced.","search":"unknown brand silverado 6500 hd chevrolet silverado 6500 hd","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Silverado%206500%20HD","reelNom":"Chevrolet Silverado 6500 HD","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chevrolet-silverado-6500-hd.svg"},{"id":"dodge-grand-caravan-taxi","nom":"Taxi Grand Caravan","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Grand Caravan 2011-2020, Chrysler Town & Country 2011-2016","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The minivan in taxi livery, taken from the Dodge Grand Caravan and its cousin, the Chrysler Town & Country. In Miami, these yellow vans handle airport runs, with sliding doors and a cargo area full of suitcases. Official screenshots catch it in traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Grand%20Caravan","reelNom":"Dodge Grand Caravan","search":"unknown brand taxi grand caravan dodge grand caravan 2011-2020, chrysler town & country 2011-2016","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dodge-grand-caravan-taxi.svg"},{"id":"mtl-packer","nom":"Packer","marque":"MTL","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"1994 International 9000/9200","src":"Second trailer","search":"mtl packer 1994 international 9000/9200","txt":"The Packer is a car hauler rig, used to transport new or impounded vehicles. Its two-level trailer makes it instantly recognizable. It’s listed from the second trailer under a community identification, with no name given by the studio.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1994%20International%209000%2F9200","reelNom":"1994 International 9000/9200","thumb":"/img/schemas/mtl-packer.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-caddy","nom":"Caddy","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"service","st":"vu","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Nagasaki’s golf cart, slow and indestructible, returns in a setting made for it: Leonida’s manicured courses. No specific real-world model is tied to it, which makes sense for such a generic vehicle. The Extended Look shows it driving between two holes.","fam":"Golf cart","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Voiturette%20de%20golf","reelNom":"Golf cart","search":"nagasaki caddy golf cart","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-caddy.svg"},{"id":"vapid-benson","nom":"Benson","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"International 4700 Delivery Truck Chassis","txt":"Mid-size box truck, bigger than the Mule and easier to handle than a semi. It’s traditionally used for heists that need cargo space.","search":"vapid benson international 4700 delivery truck chassis","src":"Extended Look","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%204700%20Delivery%20Truck%20Chassis","reelNom":"International 4700 Delivery Truck Chassis","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-benson.svg"},{"id":"vapid-police-cruiser-interceptor","nom":"Police Cruiser (Interceptor)","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Taurus","txt":"Patrol SUV, which became the standard for US police in the 2010s, replacing the sedan. Bigger cargo area, higher ground clearance.","search":"vapid police cruiser (interceptor) ford taurus","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Taurus","reelNom":"Ford Taurus","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-police-cruiser-interceptor.svg"},{"id":"vapid-police-cruiser-stanier-le","nom":"Police Cruiser (Stanier LE)","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Crown Victoria","src":"First trailer","txt":"Classic patrol car, built on the Stanier LE. The Crown Victoria served almost every US police department for twenty years: body-on-frame, rear-wheel drive, cheap to fix after a crash. Not to be confused with the Police Ghost, which uses the same base under a stealth livery.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Crown%20Victoria","reelNom":"Ford Crown Victoria","search":"vapid police cruiser (stanier le) ford crown victoria","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-police-cruiser-stanier-le.svg"},{"id":"vapid-police-ghost","nom":"Police Ghost (Stanier LE)","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Crown Victoria","src":"Second trailer","txt":"Vice City’s classic patrol car, built on a Stanier. The Crown Victoria whose looks it borrows was the standard American police car for more than twenty years: rear-wheel drive, body-on-frame, indestructible. The Ghost name points to low-profile units, whose markings you only make out once you’re too close.","search":"vapid police ghost (stanier le) ford crown victoria","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Crown%20Victoria","reelNom":"Ford Crown Victoria","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-police-ghost.svg"},{"id":"ford-explorer-police","nom":"Police Montagne","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Ford Explorer","src":"First trailer","txt":"The patrol SUV has replaced the sedan in most US police departments since the 2010s: deeper cargo area, more ground clearance, better view of traffic. The police Montagne borrows that shape and shows up as early as the first trailer on the streets of Vice City.","search":"vapid police montagne ford explorer sixth generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer","reelNom":"Ford Explorer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-explorer-police.svg"},{"id":"vapid-taxi","nom":"Stanier Taxi","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Crown Victoria","txt":"The Crown Victoria in taxi livery, with checkers down the sides and a sign on the roof. It’s the ultimate fleet sedan: huge trunk, body-on-frame, bulletproof mechanicals that are cheap to maintain. The first trailer shows it driving through Vice City traffic.","search":"vapid stanier taxi ford crown victoria","src":"First trailer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Crown%20Victoria","reelNom":"Ford Crown Victoria","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-taxi.svg"},{"id":"vapid-tow-truck","nom":"Tow Truck","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"1980s International Harvester S-Series","src":"First trailer","search":"vapid tow truck international harvester s-series 1980s","txt":"The flatbed or boom tow truck is part of the American urban landscape, from roadside assistance to towing illegally parked vehicles. The source listed for this Tow Truck is the first trailer, where the vehicle isn’t named.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%20Harvester%20s%C3%A9rie%20S%20des%20ann%C3%A9es%2080","reelNom":"1980s International Harvester S-Series","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-tow-truck.svg"},{"id":"endurex-race-bike","nom":"Race Bike","marque":"Endurex","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Pinarello Dogma","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Endurex’s racing road bike, drawn from a Pinarello Dogma: carbon frame with asymmetric chainstays, drop handlebars, deep-section rims. It’s the fastest non-motorized two-wheeler in the game. The Extended Look catches it mid-sprint.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pinarello%20Dogma","reelNom":"Pinarello Dogma","search":"endurex race bike pinarello dogma","thumb":"/img/schemas/endurex-race-bike.svg"},{"id":"bmx","nom":"BMX","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"BMX bike","src":"Official screenshots","search":"unknown brand bmx bmx bike","txt":"The bike is right there on screen; its name, nowhere. This small-wheeled bike, born in the 1970s from California kids imitating motocross, has become an Olympic sport. Miami’s skateparks make it as believable a city ride as it is a toy.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMX%20bike","reelNom":"BMX bike","thumb":"/img/schemas/bmx.svg"},{"id":"cruiser","nom":"Cruiser","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Beach cruiser, 1930s beach bike","src":"Official screenshots","search":"unknown brand cruiser beach cruiser, 1930s beach bike","txt":"The beach bike with high handlebars and a wide saddle can be spotted in the images, with no caption attached. It’s the very picture of coastal Florida: no gears, an upright riding position, wide tires for rolling over the packed sand of the boardwalks.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Beach%20cruiser","reelNom":"Beach cruiser","thumb":"/img/schemas/cruiser.svg"},{"id":"lombike","nom":"LomBike","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"CitiBike Miami E-Bikes","src":"Official screenshots","search":"unknown brand lombike citibike miami e-bikes","txt":"Practical city bike, with no sporty pretensions. This type of bicycle is mostly used for short trips and local deliveries. Its presence is only an assumption for now.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=CitiBike%20Miami%20E-Bikes","reelNom":"CitiBike Miami E-Bikes","thumb":"/img/schemas/lombike.svg"},{"id":"monorail-de-vice-city","nom":"Vice City Monorail","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Innovia APM 100, Miami Metromover","src":"Second trailer","search":"unknown brand vice city monorail innovia apm 100, miami metromover","txt":"The urban monorail is a Miami quirk: since the 1980s, the city has run an automated elevated network serving downtown. This kind of transit, rare in the US, is part of the city’s visual identity. Our database ties this monorail to the second trailer and lists the Metromover’s Innovia APM 100 as its inspiration.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Innovia%20APM%20100","reelNom":"Innovia APM 100","thumb":"/img/schemas/monorail-de-vice-city.svg"},{"id":"scorcher","nom":"Scorcher","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Saracen Zen, Rockshox Domain 180mm","src":"Official screenshots","search":"unknown brand scorcher saracen zen, rockshox domain 180mm","txt":"A mountain bike with suspension, the Scorcher is meant for trails and parks rather than the road. Mount Kalaga National Park, listed on our map, is the kind of place where this type of bike really makes sense. Official screenshots show it leaning against a low wall.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Saracen%20Zen","reelNom":"Saracen Zen","thumb":"/img/schemas/scorcher.svg"},{"id":"electric-scooter","nom":"Electric scooter","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"BIRD One","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The shared electric scooter, copied from the BIRD One you find abandoned on every sidewalk in Miami. Low deck, straight handlebar, short range and capped speed. The Extended Look lines up several of them at a rental dock.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BIRD%20One","reelNom":"BIRD One","search":"unknown brand electric scooter bird one","thumb":"/img/schemas/electric-scooter.svg"},{"id":"vcia-train","nom":"VCIA Train","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"comm","insp":null,"src":"Community match","search":"unknown brand vcia train automated airport shuttle","txt":"The shuttle linking the terminals is still a community guess, with no known name. These driverless trains are standard infrastructure at major US airports, and Vice City International Airport is on our map.","fam":"Automated airport shuttle","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Navette%20automatique%20d%E2%80%99a%C3%A9roport","reelNom":"Automated airport shuttle","thumb":"/img/schemas/vcia-train.svg"},{"id":"vcmm-train","nom":"VCMM Train","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Miami Metrorail","src":"Second trailer","search":"unknown brand vcmm train miami metrorail","txt":"Vice City’s urban train is noticeable on screen, but its name hasn’t been released. Our map lists several stations, including the airport one and the Vice City Arts Center one, which suggests a network that actually serves the city rather than just scenery.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Metrorail%20de%20Miami","reelNom":"Miami Metrorail","thumb":"/img/schemas/vcmm-train.svg"}];
